asr-000201
00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:48.280
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: to be candid,

asr-000202
00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.220
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: palagay ko hindi po sapat ang resources.

asr-000203
