00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:16.160
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: and to all members of the committee.

asr-000210
00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.360
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: To respond,

asr-000211
00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:25.300
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: the DENR's budget for a land survey

asr-000212
00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:28.300
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: as stated to resolve the disputes

asr-000213
00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:35.100
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: are not enough to implement all the land disputes

asr-000214
00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:39.300
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: to resolve the survey disputes

asr-000215
00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.460
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: relating to survey.

asr-000216
00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:46.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: There are many types of disputes on land.

asr-000217
00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.440
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Kasama na yung survey matters.

asr-000218
00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:55.320
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: So, the land cases that are handled by the DENR

asr-000219
00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:58.620
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: in our regional offices, Senros and Penros,

asr-000220
00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:02.840
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: there is a budget for dispute resolution

asr-000221
00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:06.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: like the claims and conflicts

asr-000222
00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:08.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: and alternative dispute resolution

asr-000223
00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:08.680
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: process.

asr-000224
00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:14.400
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: But the budget given is meager

asr-000225
00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:18.300
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: to resolve all the cases presented to us.

asr-000226
00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po, maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-000227
00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, naintindihan po natin,

asr-000228
00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nakulang yung budget para po sa survey.

asr-000229
00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:26.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Second question,

asr-000230
00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil nalaman niyo po na kulang,

