asr-000234
00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.680
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Patungkol po dito sa survey, Mr. Chair?

asr-000235
00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: DNR? May answer?

asr-000236
00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:45.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Sir?

asr-000237
00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Yes po, Sir.

asr-000238
00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.860
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Per request basis po,

asr-000239
00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:53.260
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: yung ating mga LGUs and applicants,

asr-000240
00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.900
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: yung mga clients po natin,

asr-000241
00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:58.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: they request the DENR

asr-000242
00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:00.640
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: for a resolution of these conflicts

asr-000243
00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.700
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: and as they are received,

asr-000244
00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.900
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: we determine kung mapupondohan po.

asr-000245
00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.380
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: So, in accordance po dun sa budget na binibigay.

asr-000246
00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:14.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: But we do our best po na makapag-implement

asr-000247
00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.240
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: depending on the budget that you are given to us.

asr-000248
00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.040
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: So, madalas po,

asr-000249
00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:21.300
