asr-000261
00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:48.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang punto ko po kung bakit ko tinatanong to Mr. Chair,

asr-000262
00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:52.520
