00:30:16.760 --> 00:30:17.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-000506
00:30:18.100 --> 00:30:20.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Puwede po bang i-discuss ng DENR, Mr. Secretary,

asr-000507
00:30:21.400 --> 00:30:27.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ano naman po yung mandato ninyo at proseso pagdating sa foreshore lands at fisher folk tenure?

asr-000508
00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:35.620
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, I may defer to the Land Management Bureau.

asr-000509
00:30:35.620 --> 00:30:36.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please go ahead.

asr-000510
00:30:36.780 --> 00:30:39.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Land Management Bureau.

asr-000511
00:30:40.580 --> 00:30:41.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Where are you?

asr-000512
00:30:46.840 --> 00:30:47.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Attorney?

asr-000513
00:30:47.820 --> 00:30:48.340
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Yes, sir.

asr-000514
00:30:48.340 --> 00:30:50.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Attorney, ikaw na naman.

asr-000515
00:30:51.780 --> 00:30:52.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bilisan mo na lang.

asr-000516
00:30:52.780 --> 00:30:56.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung answer kailangan brief, concise, direct to the point.

asr-000517
00:30:56.300 --> 00:30:58.840
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Yes, sir. For foreshore areas,

asr-000518
00:30:59.220 --> 00:31:04.060
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: ang proseso po natin, it is disposed through lease.

asr-000519
00:31:04.220 --> 00:31:05.320
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: We call it foreshore lease.

asr-000520
00:31:05.920 --> 00:31:10.480
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: And we have also requirements and procedures for that.

asr-000521
00:31:10.640 --> 00:31:18.420
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: And the tenure is foreshore lease agreement.

asr-000522
00:31:19.680 --> 00:31:25.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, Mr. Chair, before the ANR permits or recognizes use of a disputed shoreline,

asr-000523
00:31:25.940 --> 00:31:29.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: has it conclusively determined the land's legal status?

asr-000524
00:31:29.720 --> 00:31:30.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair.

asr-000525
00:31:31.840 --> 00:31:32.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please go ahead.

asr-000526
00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:33.440
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: Yes, sir.

asr-000527
00:31:34.060 --> 00:31:36.740
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: For these foreshore leases,

asr-000528
00:31:37.040 --> 00:31:40.020
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: meron po kaming mga maps,

asr-000529
00:31:40.200 --> 00:31:43.520
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: the maps that are in custody of the department.

asr-000530
00:31:43.520 --> 00:31:48.720
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: And we are currently updating the foreshore

asr-000531
00:31:48.720 --> 00:31:52.120
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: kasi kung may marami ng pagbabago sa foreshore area.

asr-000532
00:31:52.380 --> 00:31:57.220
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: For example, the cadastral survey has been conducted many years ago.

asr-000533
00:31:57.220 --> 00:32:01.160
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: And so we now have the foreshore delineation and profiling activity

asr-000534
00:32:01.160 --> 00:32:03.900
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: that is funded, Mr. and Your Honor.

asr-000535
00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:04.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sige.

asr-000536
00:32:05.140 --> 00:32:06.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000537
00:32:06.500 --> 00:32:12.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kung meron pong mga fisher folks na nag-o-occupy ng disposable foreshore public land,

asr-000538
00:32:12.980 --> 00:32:17.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ano po yung mga tenure option na available para sa kanila?

asr-000539
00:32:19.040 --> 00:32:22.240
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: For fisher folks, sir, Your Honor,

asr-000540
00:32:22.620 --> 00:32:26.380
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: through that activity of foreshore delineation,

asr-000541
00:32:26.460 --> 00:32:32.440
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: we are able to determine kung saan ba talaga naka-okupa ang mga fisher folks.

asr-000542
00:32:32.440 --> 00:32:36.660
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: So, for example, they are within the A&amp;D.

asr-000543
00:32:36.720 --> 00:32:37.380
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: For example,

asr-000544
00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:42.500
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: kasi minsan akala nila nasa foreshore sila but nasa A&amp;D naman pala.

asr-000545
00:32:42.560 --> 00:32:47.260
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: For example, sir, when we piloted the foreshore delineation in Region 1,

asr-000546
00:32:47.520 --> 00:32:53.440
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: it was found out that meron kaming specific fisher folks doon na tinignan

asr-000547
00:32:54.020 --> 00:32:56.860
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: and we found out that nasa A&amp;D sila.

asr-000548
00:32:56.860 --> 00:33:00.080
LMB Director Emelyne V. Talabis: So, sa ngayon, pinoprocess na po yung mga applications nila.

asr-000549
00:33:00.080 --> 00:33:00.329
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po.

asr-000550
00:33:00.340 --> 00:33:03.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, dahil 38 seconds na lang po ako,

asr-000551
00:33:03.700 --> 00:33:05.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi, sandali lang, sandali lang.

asr-000552
00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:06.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I-stop ko yung clock.

asr-000553
00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:06.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po.

asr-000554
00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:14.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag sinabi mong foreshore lease, doon yan sa dagat na talaga, hindi sa lupa.

asr-000555
00:33:14.620 --> 00:33:15.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Di ba?

asr-000556
00:33:15.240 --> 00:33:20.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Now, kung yung mga fisher folks, in addition to doon sa explanation,

asr-000557
00:33:20.400 --> 00:33:24.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: maibigay ko lang din for the information of our colleagues and everyone here,

asr-000558
00:33:25.380 --> 00:33:31.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung Philippine Reclamation Authority, basta meron pong puwedeng i-reclaim, maski konti.

asr-000559
00:33:31.780 --> 00:33:34.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lalo na maraming maraming fisher folks doon.

asr-000560
00:33:34.540 --> 00:33:36.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: All you have to do is write to the PRA,

asr-000561
00:33:37.280 --> 00:33:39.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ang gawin mong land for the landless.

asr-000562
00:33:39.660 --> 00:33:41.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, meron silang programang ganun.

asr-000563
00:33:41.700 --> 00:33:44.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, hindi na kailangan sila ng foreshore lease.

asr-000564
00:33:44.640 --> 00:33:48.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi pag foreshore lease, hindi natin siguradong malalim ba yun.

asr-000565
00:33:48.060 --> 00:33:52.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: O, ang ina-applyan ng foreshore lease, yung mababaw lang eh.

asr-000566
00:33:52.040 --> 00:33:53.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung malalim, hindi pwede yun.

asr-000567
00:33:53.540 --> 00:33:53.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Di ba?

asr-000568
00:33:54.300 --> 00:33:59.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, ganun yun, dear colleague, na kung marami ang fisher folks,

asr-000569
00:33:59.920 --> 00:34:02.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: makakatulong ako sa inyo dahil galing ako sa PRA

asr-000570
00:34:02.500 --> 00:34:04.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and I share this information

asr-000571
00:34:04.900 --> 00:34:07.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: that kung matambakan mo yung merong

asr-000572
00:34:07.100 --> 00:34:08.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: a reef or bahura

asr-000573
00:34:08.980 --> 00:34:11.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and you can apply land for the landless,

asr-000574
00:34:11.180 --> 00:34:12.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ibigay nila yun, permit sa iyo.

asr-000575
00:34:12.840 --> 00:34:14.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi ka pa pahirapan nun.

asr-000576
00:34:14.320 --> 00:34:16.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And I will go with you kung kailangan na kailangan yun.

asr-000577
00:34:16.480 --> 00:34:16.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you.

asr-000578
00:34:17.160 --> 00:34:18.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000579
00:34:19.080 --> 00:34:20.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Since limited po ang time ko,

asr-000580
00:34:20.720 --> 00:34:23.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meron po akong mga hihinging dokumento na lang po sa DENR

asr-000581
00:34:23.740 --> 00:34:25.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: regarding po sa mga bagay na to.

asr-000582
00:34:25.880 --> 00:34:29.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And, Mr. Chair, I am signifying my intent for second round.

asr-000583
00:34:29.940 --> 00:34:31.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yun lang po, Mr. Chair. Maraming salamat po.

asr-000584
00:34:31.780 --> 00:34:32.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay, maraming salamat.

asr-000585
00:34:33.540 --> 00:34:35.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: We go to the next.

asr-000586
00:34:35.200 --> 00:34:35.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dito pa siya, ano?

asr-000587
00:34:37.340 --> 00:34:39.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Rep. Adrian. Adrian Amatong.

asr-000588
00:34:39.660 --> 00:34:40.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dito na.

asr-000589
00:34:40.020 --> 00:34:41.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ayp.

asr-000590
00:34:41.120 --> 00:34:41.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ha?

asr-000591
00:34:41.400 --> 00:34:41.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saan na?

asr-000592
00:34:41.780 --> 00:34:44.360
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair.

asr-000593
00:34:45.860 --> 00:34:46.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hi.

asr-000594
00:34:46.220 --> 00:34:46.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Adrian.

asr-000595
00:34:47.160 --> 00:34:47.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Rep. Adrian.

asr-000596
00:34:48.780 --> 00:34:50.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Go ahead. You have the floor, sir.

asr-000597
00:34:50.740 --> 00:34:51.880
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-000598
00:34:52.160 --> 00:34:54.300
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang humingi ng assurance

asr-000599
00:34:54.300 --> 00:34:58.780
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kasi meron yung current mining company dun sa amin sa Gutalac.

asr-000600
00:34:59.060 --> 00:35:01.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Medyo naratakot ako kasi

asr-000601
00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:02.680
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ang intention nila yata nila eh

asr-000602
00:35:02.740 --> 00:35:04.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: applyan yung buong Gutalac

asr-000603
00:35:04.280 --> 00:35:07.220
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: at saka ibang areas for yung nga sa mining.

asr-000604
00:35:07.220 --> 00:35:08.260
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ang activities nila.

asr-000605
00:35:08.320 --> 00:35:10.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Gusto ko lang ma-assure na hindi mangyayari yun

asr-000606
00:35:10.720 --> 00:35:12.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kasi imagine the entire municipality.

asr-000607
00:35:16.220 --> 00:35:16.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sir?

asr-000608
00:35:20.480 --> 00:35:22.040
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, good morning.

asr-000609
00:35:22.040 --> 00:35:22.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, please, go ahead.

asr-000610
00:35:22.580 --> 00:35:23.240
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, sir.

asr-000611
00:35:23.560 --> 00:35:25.720
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Congressman Amatong, we give you our assurance.

asr-000612
00:35:27.680 --> 00:35:30.300
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Minomonitor namin yung lugar na yun

asr-000613
00:35:30.300 --> 00:35:32.320
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: specifically kasi nag-start lang sila.

asr-000614
00:35:32.660 --> 00:35:36.820
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, actually ang pinapromote po natin dyan talaga

asr-000615
00:35:36.820 --> 00:35:37.920
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: yung progressive rehabilitation.

asr-000616
00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:40.740
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, for every disturbed area,

asr-000617
00:35:40.900 --> 00:35:42.500
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: dapat po yung progressive rehab na.

asr-000618
00:35:42.640 --> 00:35:44.880
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Pati yung mga communities nila binabantayan.

asr-000619
00:35:45.120 --> 00:35:46.700
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, isa po yun sa mga ginagawin.

asr-000620
00:35:47.080 --> 00:35:50.200
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: We give you our assurance, Mr. Chair.

asr-000621
00:35:50.820 --> 00:35:52.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Okay, thank you.

asr-000622
00:35:52.040 --> 00:35:53.960
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: That company started wrong.

asr-000623
00:35:54.260 --> 00:35:54.780
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Why?

asr-000624
00:35:55.000 --> 00:35:59.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Because yung kanilang free prior and whatever consent,

asr-000625
00:35:59.920 --> 00:36:00.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: wala.

asr-000626
00:36:00.660 --> 00:36:01.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Di ba? Fatal flaw yun.

asr-000627
00:36:01.820 --> 00:36:03.460
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Dapat wala na yan dyan ngayon eh.

asr-000628
00:36:03.580 --> 00:36:05.580
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kaya lang for whatever reason, they are still there.

asr-000629
00:36:06.200 --> 00:36:10.220
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, I have a very bad experience with DNR of our area.

asr-000630
00:36:10.320 --> 00:36:10.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Why?

asr-000631
00:36:11.020 --> 00:36:12.580
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Because when they were in the process,

asr-000632
00:36:12.580 --> 00:36:13.400
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: of exploration,

asr-000633
00:36:14.040 --> 00:36:16.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: they were cutting hundreds of trees na,

asr-000634
00:36:16.900 --> 00:36:19.320
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ng malalaking trees na ilang daan taon na yan.

asr-000635
00:36:19.700 --> 00:36:22.500
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, I asked DNR to intervene, to stop them.

asr-000636
00:36:22.840 --> 00:36:24.880
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, ang sagot sa akin ng DNR,

asr-000637
00:36:25.380 --> 00:36:27.560
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ano po yan eh, mga illegal loggers.

asr-000638
00:36:27.620 --> 00:36:28.140
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I go, tangina!

asr-000639
00:36:28.820 --> 00:36:30.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Papasok ba yung illegal loggers na?

asr-000640
00:36:32.620 --> 00:36:33.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I mean, di ba?

asr-000641
00:36:33.940 --> 00:36:36.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So, I like to remind the DNR

asr-000642
00:36:36.440 --> 00:36:39.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: that our responsibility is to respect,

asr-000643
00:36:39.440 --> 00:36:40.960
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: to protect our environment.

asr-000644
00:36:41.100 --> 00:36:43.200
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: It is not, it's DNR,

asr-000645
00:36:43.280 --> 00:36:44.220
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Department of Environmental,

asr-000646
00:36:44.220 --> 00:36:45.080
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: and Natural Resources.

asr-000647
00:36:45.340 --> 00:36:47.340
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: This is not the Department of Mining Companies.

asr-000648
00:36:48.100 --> 00:36:49.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So, yun lang po.

asr-000649
00:36:49.040 --> 00:36:49.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi natatakot ako,

asr-000650
00:36:50.000 --> 00:36:51.280
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: pati yung mga constituents ko,

asr-000651
00:36:51.300 --> 00:36:53.240
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: natatakot kung anong kahihinat na ng mining

asr-000652
00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:54.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: doon sa area namin.

asr-000653
00:36:56.540 --> 00:36:56.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sir?

asr-000654
00:36:56.940 --> 00:36:57.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, go ahead.

asr-000655
00:36:57.520 --> 00:36:59.160
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Yes, Mr. Congressman.

asr-000656
00:36:59.680 --> 00:37:01.780
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: We will talk to the Reds and the RDs

asr-000657
00:37:01.780 --> 00:37:03.520
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: and take note of all your concerns.

asr-000658
00:37:03.700 --> 00:37:05.060
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: We'll take a look at the tree cutting,

asr-000659
00:37:05.200 --> 00:37:07.760
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: even the concerns you have regarding the rehab.

asr-000660
00:37:08.120 --> 00:37:08.880
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-000661
00:37:08.940 --> 00:37:11.080
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: I'll coordinate, sir, with Congressman Amatong.

asr-000662
00:37:11.220 --> 00:37:13.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Alam ko po na nag-a-apply ang kumpanyang yun na

asr-000663
00:37:13.720 --> 00:37:15.780
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: imina yung buong municipal.

asr-000664
00:37:16.380 --> 00:37:18.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Hanggang ngayon, wala akong natatanggap,

asr-000665
00:37:18.820 --> 00:37:20.260
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: wala akong pumupunta sa akin

asr-000666
00:37:20.260 --> 00:37:22.740
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: to update me kung ano ang nangyayari doon.

asr-000667
00:37:22.840 --> 00:37:24.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kung walang budget hearing,

asr-000668
00:37:24.800 --> 00:37:25.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: wala pang lalapit.

asr-000669
00:37:25.980 --> 00:37:27.660
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I mean, why is that?

asr-000670
00:37:30.260 --> 00:37:32.280
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: We apologize for that, Mr. Chair.

asr-000671
00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:35.600
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I assure you, Mr. Chair,

asr-000672
00:37:35.700 --> 00:37:37.000
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: that the regional officials

asr-000673
00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:39.260
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: will report directly to Congressman Amatong.

asr-000674
00:37:39.980 --> 00:37:41.720
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Po, tsaka magtulungan kami na

asr-000675
00:37:41.720 --> 00:37:43.680
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: to hold responsible.

asr-000676
00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:45.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ako nung, kailan ba ba?

asr-000677
00:37:45.240 --> 00:37:46.420
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Nagsabi na ako eh,

asr-000678
00:37:46.420 --> 00:37:47.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kung ano yung...

asr-000680
00:37:47.160 --> 00:37:49.500
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Rehab plan ng kumpanyang yun.

asr-000681
00:37:49.520 --> 00:37:51.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Hanggang ngayon, wala pa akong naririnig

asr-000682
00:37:51.020 --> 00:37:51.700
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: na yung rehab plan.

asr-000683
00:37:52.960 --> 00:37:53.800
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Press me na.

asr-000684
00:38:01.780 --> 00:38:02.540
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-000685
00:38:04.720 --> 00:38:06.180
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Nag-nagkita na kami ng...

asr-000686
00:38:06.840 --> 00:38:08.340
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi may nag-intervene.

asr-000687
00:38:08.340 --> 00:38:09.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Sabi, pwede ka usapin mo kasi

asr-000688
00:38:09.920 --> 00:38:11.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: antagonistic tayo

asr-000689
00:38:11.040 --> 00:38:12.460
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kasi nag-umpisa sila ng mali eh.

asr-000690
00:38:12.460 --> 00:38:14.120
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Sabi ko, sige, makikinig tayo

asr-000691
00:38:14.120 --> 00:38:15.220
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: because the law allows it.

asr-000692
00:38:15.220 --> 00:38:16.500
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: As long as you abide by the law,

asr-000693
00:38:16.500 --> 00:38:17.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: wala tayong problema.

asr-000694
00:38:17.160 --> 00:38:18.080
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Pero ang sabi ko,

asr-000695
00:38:18.080 --> 00:38:19.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: alam ko na you started wrong.

asr-000696
00:38:19.900 --> 00:38:22.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: In fact, ngayon, inamin na nga ng kumpanya eh.

asr-000697
00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:24.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kasi yung mga indigenous people dyan,

asr-000698
00:38:24.440 --> 00:38:25.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hindi naman pumayag talaga eh.

asr-000699
00:38:25.600 --> 00:38:26.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kaya lang, ang ginawa nila is

asr-000700
00:38:27.740 --> 00:38:29.380
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: nag-organize sila ng ibang grupo.

asr-000701
00:38:30.060 --> 00:38:32.160
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos, kung anong ginawa nila sa papeles,

asr-000702
00:38:33.120 --> 00:38:34.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: lumalabas na meron silang prior consent

asr-000703
00:38:34.720 --> 00:38:35.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: na wala naman talaga.

asr-000704
00:38:36.260 --> 00:38:38.620
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ito namang, mga ano, pumayag naman eh.

asr-000705
00:38:38.780 --> 00:38:39.680
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I-recognize yun.

asr-000706
00:38:39.720 --> 00:38:41.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So, nang nagkita kami,

asr-000707
00:38:41.780 --> 00:38:43.500
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: sabi ko, sige, wala tayong problema

asr-000708
00:38:43.500 --> 00:38:45.560
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: as long as you abide by the law.

asr-000709
00:38:45.840 --> 00:38:47.720
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: And I'll even warn them,

asr-000710
00:38:48.380 --> 00:38:49.900
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kung may bala kayong umapit sa akin

asr-000711
00:38:49.900 --> 00:38:50.820
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: at magbigay ng kung ano,

asr-000712
00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:52.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I'm telling you na,

asr-000713
00:38:52.020 --> 00:38:52.680
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: huwag niyong gawin

asr-000714
00:38:52.680 --> 00:38:54.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: as naslalo tayong mag-aaway dyan.

asr-000715
00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:55.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ang problema lang,

asr-000716
00:38:55.060 --> 00:38:56.360
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ng ibang agencies kasi,

asr-000717
00:38:56.360 --> 00:38:57.420
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hindi kasi ganun.

asr-000718
00:39:01.500 --> 00:39:02.060
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Ay.

asr-000719
00:39:02.060 --> 00:39:02.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Yung high na yun,

asr-000720
00:39:02.980 --> 00:39:04.860
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I can understand the frustration.

asr-000721
00:39:05.400 --> 00:39:06.960
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kaya, i-cure naman ninyo.

asr-000722
00:39:07.920 --> 00:39:08.800
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Maraming salamat.

asr-000723
00:39:08.840 --> 00:39:09.580
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Because, Mr. Chair,

asr-000724
00:39:09.880 --> 00:39:11.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: I'm here to represent my people.

asr-000725
00:39:12.700 --> 00:39:13.420
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Gusto ko,

asr-000726
00:39:13.480 --> 00:39:15.540
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: ang future nila will be protected.

asr-000727
00:39:16.020 --> 00:39:17.360
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Itong mga lalaking kumpanyang to,

asr-000728
00:39:17.440 --> 00:39:18.580
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: pagkatapos magmina dyan,

asr-000729
