asr-001170
01:06:18.680 --> 01:06:22.060
DENR Undersecretary Jonas R. Leones: But even then, just to inform the Honorable Congresswoman

asr-001171
01:06:22.060 --> 01:06:28.420
DENR Undersecretary Jonas R. Leones: that we have already allocated for 2027 an amount of 60 million

asr-001172
01:06:28.420 --> 01:06:34.600
DENR Undersecretary Jonas R. Leones: for monitoring, compliance monitoring of these tenure holders that we have awarded.

asr-001173
01:06:34.860 --> 01:06:36.260
DENR Undersecretary Jonas R. Leones: Madam Congresswoman.

asr-001174
01:06:36.340 --> 01:06:37.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 60 million, right?

asr-001175
01:06:37.460 --> 01:06:38.280
DENR Undersecretary Jonas R. Leones: 60 million.

asr-001176
01:06:38.640 --> 01:06:39.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yes.

asr-001177
01:06:39.100 --> 01:06:41.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: That's the answer, Representative Ismula.

asr-001178
01:06:41.400 --> 01:06:41.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes.

asr-001179
