asr-001254
01:10:27.120 --> 01:10:27.920
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay, thank you.

asr-001255
01:10:28.448 --> 01:10:31.755
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair.

asr-001256
01:10:31.755 --> 01:10:33.753
