asr-001257
01:10:33.753 --> 01:10:44.741
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Every budget hearing that the National Solid Waste Management Commission is a separate office under the Office of the President.

asr-001258
01:10:44.741 --> 01:10:55.730
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: However, Mr. Chair, for the information of everybody, the Chairman of the Commission is the Secretary of the DNR.

asr-001259
01:10:55.730 --> 01:11:01.724
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kaya po malaki ang ginagampanan ng DNR sa komisyong ito.

asr-001260
01:11:01.724 --> 01:11:17.707
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang Environmental Management Bureau din po ng DNR ay may mandato na mag-monitor at mag-imporse ng environmental law kasama ang Republic Act 9003.

asr-001261
01:11:17.707 --> 01:11:23.621
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair, last budget hearing.

asr-001262
01:11:23.621 --> 01:11:34.649
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang ating po nga sekretary ngayon ay dati pong Undersecretary in charge of Solid Waste Management.

asr-001263
01:11:34.649 --> 01:11:45.638
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: That is why alam po niya ang problema dahil palagi ko tinatanong sa kanya regarding Republic Act 9003.

asr-001264
01:11:45.638 --> 01:11:57.420
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang sabi niya po sa akin nung mga nakarang taon kanya na pong inaayos ang mga problema

asr-001265
01:11:57.420 --> 01:12:06.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa mga waste management para hindi na magkaroon ng problema sa public health loan.

asr-001268
