DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: is yung mga tao nakatira along the waterways is another concern that has to be addressed.

asr-001997
01:45:19.060 --> 01:45:24.640
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Dahil pag hindi po efficient yung collection, lalo na sa mga highly urbanized areas,

asr-001998
01:45:24.760 --> 01:45:33.240
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: pagdating sa mga looban, kahit mali po siya, the most convenient thing would be to throw it in the waterways

asr-001999
01:45:33.240 --> 01:45:37.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: and let it go with the flow ng tubig po. So that's another issue po.

asr-002000
01:45:38.180 --> 01:45:41.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Secretary. You mentioned that the law was passed in 2008, correct?

asr-002001
01:45:43.080 --> 01:45:45.800
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: If my recollection serves me right.

asr-002002
01:45:46.020 --> 01:45:47.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yes, because 2008.

asr-002003
01:45:48.720 --> 01:45:53.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Was you became the PENRO, right?

asr-002004
01:45:53.480 --> 01:45:54.200
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002005
01:45:54.200 --> 01:45:55.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then you became Regional Director of the NAR?

asr-002006
01:45:56.480 --> 01:45:58.540
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: No, not Regional Director, Mr. Chair. Director.

asr-002007
01:45:58.900 --> 01:45:59.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So Assistant Secretary?

asr-002008
01:46:00.000 --> 01:46:00.640
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, sir.

asr-002009
01:46:00.720 --> 01:46:02.020
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then Undersecretary?

asr-002010
01:46:02.500 --> 01:46:03.120
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, sir.

asr-002011
01:46:03.200 --> 01:46:13.060
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And now you are the Secretary who is a career official who always works with integrity and efficiency in our government.

asr-002012
01:46:13.200 --> 01:46:13.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is that correct?

asr-002013
01:46:15.520 --> 01:46:18.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Let's give a big hand for the Secretary. Yan ang karir eh.

asr-002014
01:46:18.660 --> 01:46:26.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So therefore, we congratulate you and that is why we are having this budget hearing to increase your budget.

asr-002015
01:46:26.400 --> 01:46:27.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-002016
01:46:27.040 --> 01:46:30.020
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, again, Col. Nica, please proceed.

asr-002017
01:46:30.960 --> 01:46:33.120
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002018
01:46:33.220 --> 01:46:38.540
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, last question. I think that was already brought up with my R.E.D. a while ago.

asr-002019
01:46:38.680 --> 01:46:48.220
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: But I would just like to reiterate the status or, you know, to fund po sana yung reestablishment of political boundaries.

asr-002020
01:46:48.220 --> 01:46:53.920
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: And control points and relocation of lots of Lahar-affected areas, specifically in Bacolor.

asr-002021
01:46:53.920 --> 01:46:58.660
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Because I came from Bacolor and we all know the history of Bacolor, no?

asr-002022
01:46:58.660 --> 01:47:05.020
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, nalahar po yan. So, lahat ng tao na rin na-resettle na po yan sa ibang towns.

asr-002023
01:47:05.020 --> 01:47:16.360
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: And, of course, since obligasyon po natin na hopefully makabalik sila, eh ang problema naman po kasi yung boundaries, no?

asr-002024
01:47:16.360 --> 01:47:18.420
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, yung iba...

asr-002025
01:47:18.420 --> 01:47:22.000
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Asa na ba yung lote ko? They don't even know where their lot is.

asr-002026
01:47:22.000 --> 01:47:33.920
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, I would just like to reiterate na sana po supportan po ng DNR yung aking request, yung funding po sa political boundaries and control points sa ating mga Lahar-affected areas.

asr-002027
01:47:34.160 --> 01:47:37.940
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, that's all, Mr. Chair. And thank you, DNR family.

asr-002028
01:47:38.460 --> 01:47:46.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Rep. Gonzalez. Do we get the commitment for additional funds for the district of Congressman Micla Gonzalez?

asr-002029
01:47:46.420 --> 01:47:48.640
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, thank you, Mr. Chair. Actually, we've spoken already.

asr-002030
01:47:48.640 --> 01:47:53.900
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you to the Regional Executive Director, Mr. Chair, to submit this request, Mr. Chair.

asr-002031
01:47:54.700 --> 01:47:56.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you. That's a very correct answer.

asr-002032
01:47:57.600 --> 01:48:00.140
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, are you satisfied with that correct answer?

asr-002033
01:48:00.580 --> 01:48:03.100
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: I'm a very happy Congresswoman.

asr-002034
01:48:03.100 --> 01:48:04.720
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Rep. Micla.

asr-002035
01:48:05.260 --> 01:48:08.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: May I now call, now we go back to the minority.

asr-002036
01:48:08.360 --> 01:48:19.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And hear my good friend, who was with me in Germany and who is the representative of the island paradise of Dinagat Island.

asr-002038
01:48:21.120 --> 01:48:23.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Congresswoman Governor Kaka Bag-ao.

asr-002039
01:48:23.840 --> 01:48:26.520
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Good morning, Mr. Chair. Good morning po, Sec.

asr-002040
01:48:28.200 --> 01:48:31.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Law school pa lang. Sinalan na kita.

asr-002041
01:48:33.100 --> 01:48:36.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ang tanong ko lang po, simple lang naman po talaga. Ang sadya ko ngayon.

asr-002042
01:48:37.160 --> 01:48:47.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Doon po sa budget ng monitoring ng DENR, lalo na ng MGB sa operation ng mga mining companies,

asr-002043
01:48:48.380 --> 01:48:53.420
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kasama halimbawa po ang magsasara na ng mining companies, kung sila ba ay compliant,

asr-002044
01:48:53.940 --> 01:48:59.280
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: o kayo yung mga mining companies na may pending application, pero hindi pa napoprocess.

asr-002045
01:49:00.140 --> 01:49:02.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Magkano po yung budget ng MGB dyan?

asr-002046
01:49:03.260 --> 01:49:08.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: And siguro, idugtong yun ah, in particular, alam ko, satellite office lang yung Dinagat.

asr-002047
01:49:08.400 --> 01:49:10.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, magkano po yung sa Caraga?

asr-002048
01:49:12.060 --> 01:49:14.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Dalawang item lang po, national at regional.

asr-002049
01:49:16.040 --> 01:49:17.620
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002050
01:49:18.020 --> 01:49:19.900
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I defer to Usec. Ana Teh of Finance.

asr-002051
01:49:20.240 --> 01:49:22.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Usec. Ana Teh, please respond.

asr-002052
01:49:22.820 --> 01:49:23.820
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002053
01:49:24.060 --> 01:49:33.580
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: The budget for monitoring under strengthening mineral regulation services through enhanced enforcement is about 53.6 million, Mr. Chair.

asr-002054
01:49:34.140 --> 01:49:37.020
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: 53.6 million for the whole Philippines?

asr-002055
01:49:37.280 --> 01:49:37.420
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Million.

asr-002056
01:49:39.220 --> 01:49:40.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: For the whole Philippines, ma'am?

asr-002057
01:49:41.340 --> 01:49:42.020
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yes.

asr-002058
01:49:42.020 --> 01:49:43.240
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At sa karaga po?

asr-002059
01:49:44.380 --> 01:49:45.700
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: How much for karaga?

asr-002060
01:49:45.700 --> 01:49:47.800
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Of the 63 million?

asr-002061
01:49:47.800 --> 01:49:48.320
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Million.

asr-002062
01:49:49.340 --> 01:49:52.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, we await the figures to be given.

asr-002063
01:50:00.220 --> 01:50:02.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Can you proceed to the next question?

asr-002064
01:50:02.680 --> 01:50:03.020
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yes, po.

asr-002066
01:50:03.320 --> 01:50:07.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I assume that you are getting the numbers.

asr-002067
01:50:08.100 --> 01:50:15.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: However, ang gusto ko lang pong ipoint out that because an island where a lot of mining companies are present, like dinagat,

asr-002068
01:50:16.060 --> 01:50:22.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: is considered as a satellite office, technically walang allocated na specific budget for monitoring.

asr-002069
01:50:23.320 --> 01:50:25.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, I hope...

asr-002070
01:50:25.180 --> 01:50:38.540
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Hindi part ng monitoring ninyo na kapag nag-i-inform kayo sa probinsya kagaya ng dinagat ng mga status ng mga mining companies,

asr-002071
01:50:38.760 --> 01:50:42.040
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung ito ay suspended, et cetera, ay hindi nyo idadaan sa Facebook.

asr-002072
01:50:42.240 --> 01:50:54.200
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, yesterday, August 25, because there has already been clamor for closing a very small area in Hibusong Island,

asr-002073
01:50:56.330 --> 01:51:00.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: What you did, ang ginawa po natin ay naglabas ng notice to the public, Sec.

asr-002074
01:51:00.760 --> 01:51:04.860
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At ang notice to the public ay dinaan sa Facebook.

asr-002075
01:51:05.680 --> 01:51:09.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At doon po sa notice, ang sabi po ninyo ay kahapon lang po ito,

asr-002076
01:51:09.940 --> 01:51:16.100
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: hindi ko alam dahil ba ito ba dumudugtong sa budget hearing,

asr-002077
01:51:16.100 --> 01:51:20.140
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: dahil may committee hearing tayo ngayon at may demand yung public to explain.

asr-002078
01:51:20.460 --> 01:51:25.560
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ang Facebook page po ay contrary to what is circulating online.

asr-002079
01:51:25.760 --> 01:51:29.980
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: There is no approved mineral exploration in Hibusong Island.

asr-002080
01:51:30.220 --> 01:51:36.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero alam po ng mga taga-Hibusong, taga-Dinagat, at ninyo din na may pwedeng application ang East Coast Mining Corporation.

asr-002081
01:51:37.340 --> 01:51:47.020
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At in fact, 10 years ago, sabi nyo, may suspension na ito noong 2014, suspension order noong 2014,

asr-002082
01:51:47.020 --> 01:51:53.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung saan, kung resuman din po ako at naitanong ko na din po ito, 2014 pa po,

asr-002084
01:51:55.000 --> 01:51:58.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ang threat ng operation ng East Coast Mining sa Dinagat Island, Sir,

asr-002085
01:52:00.420 --> 01:52:05.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I'm sure, please don't respond to me by saying that there is no mining operation in Hibusong.

asr-002086
01:52:06.600 --> 01:52:10.140
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Of course, everyday po nababantayan po yan ang mga tao.

asr-002087
01:52:10.340 --> 01:52:14.120
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At lagi pong may rally, kailang malungkot kapag ka-budget hearing,

asr-002088
01:52:14.320 --> 01:52:19.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: itatanong namin ulit, ito pong suspension order, kailan po ito matatapos?

asr-002089
01:52:19.500 --> 01:52:23.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasi ang commitment po sa akin noong mga dati pong secretary pa,

asr-002090
01:52:24.100 --> 01:52:31.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Syempre mamalasing ka, sir, kasi maabutan ka, na ito po ay suspension order pa rin hanggang ngayon.

asr-002091
01:52:32.520 --> 01:52:35.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kailan po ito talaga madedeclare na area closed for mining,

asr-002092
01:52:36.900 --> 01:52:43.000
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ilang beses na po din sa loob ng sampung taong ko sa Dinagat, bilang representative at governor din po,

asr-002093
01:52:43.500 --> 01:52:47.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ilang taon na din pong pinagdebatihan at naglabas na po ng study,

asr-002094
01:52:47.720 --> 01:52:54.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ang DENR po, that it should not be open for mining operations because of the vulnerability.

asr-002096
01:52:54.900 --> 01:53:06.360
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, there are more than 100 areas that was already declared by LGUs at mga sangguniang barangay po,

asr-002097
01:53:06.360 --> 01:53:14.280
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: declaring it conservation areas for protecting the vulnerability of the island.

asr-002098
01:53:14.640 --> 01:53:19.580
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, ang tanong ko po, Sek, dahil wala po akong may tatanong sa budget,

asr-002099
01:53:19.680 --> 01:53:25.100
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: dahil satellite po ang, alin po doon sa budget nyo, para hindi po po pipilitan na Facebook,

asr-002100
01:53:25.100 --> 01:53:26.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: page lang ang communication.

asr-002101
01:53:26.180 --> 01:53:38.200
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, sir, itong suspension order nyo, wala pong notice at wala pong communication sa LGU at sa mga tagat mamamayan ng Dinagat, sir.

asr-002102
01:53:38.760 --> 01:53:44.340
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Magpapasalamat lang ako kay Kong Dago, kasi kasama ko po siya nagpapainay sa issue na ito.

asr-002103
01:53:44.440 --> 01:53:51.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero sadly, sir, sa isang maliit na isla, kagaya ng Hibusong na hindi po pwede magdepend sa Facebook,

asr-002104
01:53:51.760 --> 01:53:54.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: hindi po pwede ang notice nyo po.

asr-002105
01:53:54.900 --> 01:54:07.280
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: sa amin to say that there is no expiration or as of September 18, 2014, has been suspended through a Facebook post.

asr-002106
01:54:07.920 --> 01:54:13.880
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Hindi ko rin po nakita si MGB Director, sir, to even visit Dinagat Islands.

asr-002107
01:54:14.140 --> 01:54:22.060
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, I don't see anyone from there who visits the small island of Dinagat to update us on the status of mining application.

asr-002108
01:54:22.480 --> 01:54:24.980
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero magpapasalamat lang ako kay Usec.

asr-002109
01:54:24.980 --> 01:54:27.600
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasi sinalubong niya ako, Usec. Fragada.

asr-002110
01:54:27.960 --> 01:54:38.680
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At sinalubong niya po ako para sabihin na maybe we can expand even the discussion of Hibusong to go into the other mining applications who are marami din naman po.

asr-002111
01:54:38.800 --> 01:54:50.140
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, sir, pakisagot naman, magkano po ang pwede mo nating asahan para po sa monitoring ng mining operations ng Dinagat na napaka, hindi naman po konti.

asr-002112
01:54:50.500 --> 01:54:51.840
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, I can say more than ten.

asr-002113
01:54:53.260 --> 01:54:53.700
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Secretary?

asr-002114
01:54:54.340 --> 01:54:55.080
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002115
01:54:55.160 --> 01:54:59.340
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: On the aspect of the budget, I defer to Usec. Ana Teh of Finance.

asr-002116
01:55:00.820 --> 01:55:02.000
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002117
01:55:02.900 --> 01:55:08.580
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: Mr. Chair, for Caraga, we have a budget of 12.29 million for the whole region.

asr-002118
01:55:08.840 --> 01:55:18.500
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: So, there's no specific breakdown how much is dedicated for Dinagat Island because there's no PENRA yet in Dinagat Island.

asr-002119
01:55:18.640 --> 01:55:23.380
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: But, Mr. Chair, what we can do is that there's also a budget allocation.

asr-002120
01:55:23.380 --> 01:55:34.760
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: For other activities within the region which we can actually utilize to ensure that there's proper monitoring on the different environmental activities in the island, Mr. Chair.

asr-002121
01:55:36.380 --> 01:55:37.440
DENR Undersecretary Analiza Rebuelta-Teh: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002122
01:55:37.440 --> 01:55:37.780
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: May I respond?

asr-002123
01:55:37.840 --> 01:55:40.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: May I allow you to make a rejoinder?

asr-002124
01:55:40.860 --> 01:55:41.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002125
01:55:41.820 --> 01:55:49.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, yun po ang magiging problema natin, Usec., dahil wala pong specific allocation for Dinagat.

asr-002126
01:55:50.140 --> 01:55:53.240
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Considering it's a very vulnerable island.

asr-002127
01:55:53.400 --> 01:55:56.800
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Napakarami pong areas that should be protected.

asr-002128
01:55:56.800 --> 01:56:03.520
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero po halimbawa, bonsai forest, may pending mining application sinuspending po ninyo.

asr-002129
01:56:03.520 --> 01:56:05.540
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Hindi rin po namin alam ano pong mangyayari.

asr-002130
01:56:05.540 --> 01:56:06.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ano po ba?

asr-002131
01:56:06.820 --> 01:56:10.160
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Asa po ba kami isasara ito dahil bonsai forest po siya.

asr-002132
01:56:10.160 --> 01:56:14.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Tatlo lang po ang bonsai forest sa buong Pilipinas kasama ang Dinagat Islands.

asr-002133
01:56:14.180 --> 01:56:18.280
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero hanggang ngayon may MPSA application po, Sec.

asr-002134
01:56:18.280 --> 01:56:23.380
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At in fact, may declaration na ang DENR na sana po ay hindi matuloy ang mining dyan.

asr-002135
01:56:24.240 --> 01:56:31.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Dahilan po, ang threat sa amin, araw-araw, at nagkaka-declare lang po ng aming LGU ng State of Calamity

asr-002136
01:56:31.900 --> 01:56:37.120
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kasi 17,000 na po ang naapektuhan ng absence ng tubig.

asr-002137
01:56:37.180 --> 01:56:42.120
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasi kung dito po ay baha ang issue, doon po ay wala po kaming tubig dahil sa sobrang init.

asr-002138
01:56:42.120 --> 01:56:50.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At ang pinagbibintangan po kayo sa amin, na ang dahilan po ay dahil napuputol ang lahat ng puno sa aming mga bukid.

asr-002139
01:56:50.180 --> 01:56:53.880
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero kung lack of education and information,

asr-002140
01:56:54.280 --> 01:56:59.640
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: wala po kaming makakausap kasi wala po kayong opisyal na pumupunta sa amin to monitor.

asr-002141
01:56:59.840 --> 01:57:03.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Specifically, sir, can I ask that we talk about this?

asr-002142
01:57:03.840 --> 01:57:07.640
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I will wait. I will not accuse you of anything yet.

asr-002143
01:57:07.900 --> 01:57:13.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pero can I ask lang po, una po, can somebody go there?

