DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Number two, for that particular island, we apologize if there was an announcement made through social media.

asr-002170
01:59:05.120 --> 01:59:14.400
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: But officially, I will make sure that the region comes up with a proper statement regarding the notice to the public.

