asr-002926
02:19:48.220 --> 02:19:54.520
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, dapat po na magkaroon po tayo ng pag-aaral as to how we can properly dispose of these.

asr-002927
02:19:54.660 --> 02:19:56.900
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Before yung end life po nitong mga...

asr-002928
02:19:56.900 --> 02:19:59.340
