Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang iba, naka-install na yan eh.

asr-002934
02:20:22.220 --> 02:20:24.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Going 5 years, going 6 years na.

asr-002935
02:20:24.200 --> 02:20:29.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, in the next 2 or 3 years, meron na yung mga lithium batteries to be disposed of.

asr-002936
02:20:29.700 --> 02:20:34.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, as they're not ready, Visayas and Mindanao, saan ba ito mangyayari?

asr-002937
02:20:34.860 --> 02:20:40.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi kung wala, kung wala namang kayong personnel in order to go around.

asr-002938
02:20:40.680 --> 02:20:50.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Remember, the rooftop solar and the batteries in relation to the question of Representative Nagooc is universal.

asr-002939
02:20:51.880 --> 02:20:53.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Philippine-wide yan, nationwide yan.

asr-002940
02:20:53.960 --> 02:20:54.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: All I love...

asr-002941
02:20:56.660 --> 02:20:58.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, how do you cope up with that?

asr-002942
02:20:58.880 --> 02:21:04.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It's an environmental nightmare kung saan-saan mo lang masipa ito sa kalsada, sa kanal, nakatiwangwang dun.

asr-002943
02:21:04.480 --> 02:21:06.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Di ba? Especially the lithium.

asr-002944
02:21:06.680 --> 02:21:07.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay? Thank you.

asr-002945
02:21:09.340 --> 02:21:14.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Cherno, naintindihan ko, mahirap po sagutin yan.

asr-002946
02:21:15.220 --> 02:21:18.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nga, sabi ko kanina, in advance ko na.

asr-002947
02:21:18.300 --> 02:21:25.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, just imagine in Metro Manila, kahit 30% lang ng kabahayan dito,

asr-002948
02:21:26.740 --> 02:21:34.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: saan mo, din, nakikita mo yung inaugurate ni Presidente, napakalaking mga battery storage facilities.

asr-002949
02:21:34.880 --> 02:21:37.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Wala pa po tayong batas ngayon yan.

asr-002950
02:21:37.100 --> 02:21:40.220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung base namin, nandun pa.

asr-002951
02:21:41.060 --> 02:21:47.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, in advance ko yan, pag-isipan na ninyo, dito sa budget ninyo, Mr. Sekretary,

asr-002952
02:21:47.160 --> 02:22:06.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I will humbly request na i-consider ninyo, kasi mangyayari yan. And, kasi because of the high cost of electricity that we have now, kaya nagkaroon tayo ng mga batas na mapagaan yung ano, one is the sariling kurinti, kanya-kanya na tayong install.

asr-002956
02:22:06.280 --> 02:22:09.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, at malaki po ang trabaho na gagawin ng DENR.

asr-002957
02:22:10.060 --> 02:22:16.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, no need to answer, kasi mahirap yun sagutin.

asr-002958
02:22:16.260 --> 02:22:22.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, on the next point, Mr. Chair, may problema tayo, Mr. Chair,

asr-002960
02:22:23.120 --> 02:22:28.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mga tao na nagtatrabaho in one of the mining companies in Dinagat.

asr-002961
02:22:29.020 --> 02:22:31.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Napuntahan na nila, but until now, hindi po nasasahuran.

asr-002962
02:22:32.180 --> 02:22:33.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: May kaso na po ito.

asr-002963
02:22:33.640 --> 02:22:39.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can the Secretary, in the Secretary level,

asr-002964
02:22:39.320 --> 02:22:47.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: assure this representation na while nagkaso yung mining company at saka yung outsource niya,

asr-002965
02:22:47.140 --> 02:22:53.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ay mabigyan man lang ng kahit installment basis,

asr-002966
02:22:53.420 --> 02:22:55.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung salaries and wages ng mga nagtatrabaho?

asr-002967
02:22:55.420 --> 02:23:01.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi sa ngayon, wala. Napaka-unfair naman yun. Pinagtatrabaho nila yun.

asr-002968
02:23:02.700 --> 02:23:03.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002969
02:23:04.360 --> 02:23:09.020
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: We will request not only the regional office of MGB,

asr-002970
02:23:09.020 --> 02:23:13.340
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: but the central office to coordinate with this particular mining company, Mr. Chair,

asr-002971
02:23:13.420 --> 02:23:20.600
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: to assure that the workers are properly compensated.

asr-002972
02:23:20.760 --> 02:23:23.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ano ba 'yan, Cong. Dagooc? Pilipino ba 'yan?

asr-002973
02:23:23.920 --> 02:23:26.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi karamihan lang sa Surigao Mining, puro na Chinese eh.

asr-002974
02:23:27.980 --> 02:23:30.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kilala ni Secretary yung I don't want to mention.

asr-002975
02:23:31.460 --> 02:23:45.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang gusto ko lang mangyari, kasi nagtuturo na yung mining company na yung service provider niya ang dapat magbayad. Ngayon, kinasuhanan niya dahil hindi nagbayad.

asr-002977
02:23:46.000 --> 02:23:51.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: My request to the Secretary is DENR's intervention.

asr-002978
02:23:51.840 --> 02:23:56.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na makausap to... Nakausap tong mining company na while nagkaso sila,

asr-002980
02:23:56.480 --> 02:24:00.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ay kahit mag-parcel payment muna sila,

asr-002981
02:24:00.240 --> 02:24:02.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi walang, hindi nakapagtrabaho yung mga tao doon.

asr-002982
02:24:02.680 --> 02:24:08.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dahil doon nagtatrabaho sa mining. Kumita na sila. Hinakot na nila yung or.

asr-002984
02:24:08.540 --> 02:24:13.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, can the Secretary give an assurance for the intervention of DENR

asr-002985
02:24:13.660 --> 02:24:16.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na mabayaran muna kahit parcial.

asr-002986
02:24:18.880 --> 02:24:26.740
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes, Mr. Chair. I will have Usec Mark coordinate with you to get the particular mining company so we can coordinate with them, Mr. Chair.

asr-002988
02:24:28.000 --> 02:24:33.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: With Usec Mark, sa experience ko sa kanya, alam ko this can be done.

asr-002989
02:24:33.580 --> 02:24:39.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi naanaw ko sa tao, naamiss ako doon sa kanyang, ano, 1 ticks away, 2 ticks away.

asr-002990
02:24:40.540 --> 02:24:42.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag natanggap niya, inaaksyonan niya kagad.

asr-002991
02:24:42.960 --> 02:24:51.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I hope maraming Usec Mark sa DENR, kasi yung mga, yung mga ibang, mga ibang inaano mo, wala eh.

asr-002992
02:24:51.400 --> 02:24:51.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sandali,

asr-002993
02:24:51.920 --> 02:24:56.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sandali. Favoritism yan. Bakit yung taga-Siargao, one text away.

asr-002995
02:24:56.200 --> 02:24:59.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kami sa Palawan, anim na buwan na, wala pang aksyon.

asr-002996
02:24:59.820 --> 02:25:01.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ha, favoritism yan.

asr-002997
02:25:01.340 --> 02:25:05.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi ka siguro nag-text, no? Hindi ka siguro nag-text, Mr. Chair.

asr-002999
02:25:06.520 --> 02:25:13.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero ako, pumunta doon yung MJB, pumunta doon yung RA Day, mga bagong appointment lang yun, mga bagong upo.

asr-003000
02:25:14.180 --> 02:25:18.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon, kung hindi ako makuntento, mag-text lang ako kay Usec Mark, bumalik naman doon eh.

asr-003001
02:25:18.600 --> 02:25:20.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, may mga...

asr-003002
02:25:20.880 --> 02:25:22.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Finally, Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang...

asr-003003
02:25:24.360 --> 02:25:37.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ipaabot yung pasasalamat to the Secretary through the USEC, through USEC mark and yung MJB Region 13, RA Region 13.

asr-003004
02:25:39.100 --> 02:25:46.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung mga ipa-follow up na lang nila dito na non-complying mining operators.

asr-003005
02:25:46.160 --> 02:25:51.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon namang mga nag-operate na based on the report, substantially compliant.

asr-003006
02:25:51.460 --> 02:25:53.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, wala lang tayong problema doon.

asr-003008
02:25:53.980 --> 02:26:02.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, yung mga non-compliant, dapat may makita kami ni Kung Kaka na compliance.

asr-003009
02:26:02.380 --> 02:26:04.540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi initial report lang to.

asr-003010
02:26:04.600 --> 02:26:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dapat ma-comply nila.

asr-003011
02:26:05.840 --> 02:26:07.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003012
02:26:08.020 --> 02:26:09.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, DENR.

asr-003013
02:26:09.300 --> 02:26:09.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Time is up.

asr-003014
02:26:09.900 --> 02:26:10.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Is that all?

asr-003015
02:26:10.920 --> 02:26:11.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala na?

asr-003016
02:26:12.340 --> 02:26:12.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala na.

asr-003017
02:26:13.100 --> 02:26:13.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay.

asr-003018
02:26:13.540 --> 02:26:17.620
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, may we request for a two-minute health break?

asr-003019
02:26:17.780 --> 02:26:18.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay.

asr-003020
02:26:18.180 --> 02:26:19.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, two-minute break.

asr-003021
02:38:43.760 --> 02:38:54.950
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: The Lone District of Ormoc, Congressman Richard Gomez, the fencing champion of Visayas.

asr-003022
02:38:54.960 --> 02:38:55.550
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bai.

asr-003023
02:38:55.560 --> 02:38:58.350
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003024
02:38:58.360 --> 02:39:02.580
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Hapon, magandang hapon.

asr-003027
02:39:02.580 --> 02:39:09.940
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I sent you a letter regarding the Palumpon watershed problem, which we investigated last Congress.

asr-003028
02:39:12.300 --> 02:39:15.780
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: But it's too long to take it up here today.

asr-003029
02:39:16.000 --> 02:39:18.900
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So please take a look at it and review that.

asr-003030
02:39:19.400 --> 02:39:24.600
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I think there's still a lot of problems going on with the watershed program.

asr-003031
02:39:27.660 --> 02:39:35.500
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: And then, I want you, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary, to take a look at illegal activities in our district.

asr-003032
02:39:35.780 --> 02:39:41.990
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: There are a lot of illegal logging happening.

asr-003033
02:39:41.990 --> 02:39:45.800
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Illegal quarrying, illegal mining happening around my district.

asr-003034
02:39:47.220 --> 02:39:50.280
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Ang tinitignan ko lang yung district ko, hindi ko tinitignan yung ibang distrito.

asr-003035
02:39:50.580 --> 02:39:52.200
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Kasi yun lang yung kino-cover ko.

asr-003036
02:39:53.240 --> 02:40:04.680
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Just to let you know, Mr. Secretary, so that you'll know how much I care for the environment when I was mayor.

asr-003037
02:40:04.680 --> 02:40:07.180
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I closed all quarrying activities in Ormoc City.

asr-003038
02:40:07.880 --> 02:40:12.580
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: And then sinabi ko sa inyo, if you do not follow the law, if you do not follow all the...

asr-003039
02:40:12.580 --> 02:40:15.620
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: permits, licenses, you cannot operate even

asr-003040
02:40:15.620 --> 02:40:17.860
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: up to rehabilitation plant, kailangan kumpleto.

asr-003041
02:40:17.860 --> 02:40:21.200
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So lahat ng mga nakakompleto, we'll assume that.

asr-003042
02:40:21.340 --> 02:40:28.040
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: But we instituted an open and closed season for quarrying for sand and gravel.

asr-003043
02:40:28.380 --> 02:40:33.660
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: And also we instituted through an executive order, which is now an ordinance,

asr-003044
02:40:33.660 --> 02:40:37.580
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: that they cannot export any minerals outside of Ormoc City.

asr-003045
02:40:38.040 --> 02:40:41.980
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So kung galing sa ibang lugar yung sand and gravel, pumasok ng Ormoc City,

asr-003046
02:40:42.040 --> 02:40:44.140
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: hindi mo na mailalabas 'yon, hanggang doon ka lang.

asr-003047
02:40:44.460 --> 02:40:47.200
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: That is to save our environment.

asr-003048
02:40:47.200 --> 02:40:51.400
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Because when I sat as mayor, itong building natin sa Congress, kayang pumasok doon sa butas na ginawa nila.

asr-003049
02:40:51.660 --> 02:40:53.440
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Ganun-ganun yung problema naabutan ko.

asr-003050
02:40:53.440 --> 02:40:54.840
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: That's why I'm very passionate about this.

asr-003051
02:40:57.660 --> 02:41:02.040
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I set up our own WACMA in Ormoc City for water quality management.

asr-003052
02:41:02.760 --> 02:41:08.900
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: We instituted also a ban on single-use plastics in Ormoc. Maraming against it

asr-003053
02:41:08.900 --> 02:41:10.500
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: but wala, there's nothing we can do.

asr-003054
02:41:10.700 --> 02:41:12.320
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: We have to do it as

asr-003055
02:41:12.320 --> 02:41:14.160
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: As leaders of our place.

asr-003056
02:41:15.760 --> 02:41:22.380
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I will also send you a summary on our concerns regarding illegal logging and illegal quarrying.

asr-003057
02:41:24.580 --> 02:41:29.380
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: The mayor of Ormoc City, I believe, gave you a call with regards to our water system.

asr-003058
02:41:29.700 --> 02:41:34.960
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I don't know if you can help on that aspect, but I think may problema yata.

asr-003059
02:41:34.960 --> 02:41:39.320
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Because Ormoc City operates our own water system.

asr-003060
02:41:39.440 --> 02:41:41.100
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: We're not under LUA.

asr-003061
02:41:41.100 --> 02:41:44.230
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So we will see how we can do things together.

asr-003062
02:41:44.240 --> 02:41:51.760
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: But all of this, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary, all of this, I'll put it in writing, some have been sent to your office.

asr-003063
02:41:52.100 --> 02:41:57.780
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Alam mo, kami yung mga, isa sa mga gustong tumulong sa problema natin sa environment.

asr-003064
02:41:57.780 --> 02:42:06.060
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Because we know that our environmental performance index, as written here, is what? 162 out of 177.

asr-003065
02:42:06.060 --> 02:42:08.960
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So, in our own little way, kung makakatulong kami sa inyo, please allow us to help you.

asr-003066
02:42:09.680 --> 02:42:11.630
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: That is our concern.

asr-003067
02:42:11.630 --> 02:42:11.920
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So, please.

asr-003068
02:42:11.920 --> 02:42:13.900
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: yung mga ipapadala namin ng mga documents,

asr-003069
02:42:13.900 --> 02:42:16.980
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Please take a good look at it and then please act on it.

asr-003070
02:42:17.100 --> 02:42:20.560
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Yun lang, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary. Salamat.

asr-003071
02:42:20.560 --> 02:42:23.150
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you.

asr-003072
02:42:23.620 --> 02:42:26.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sir, Ormoc City, baka water permit yan.

asr-003073
02:42:27.120 --> 02:42:30.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I know their water source in Ormoc is very big.

asr-003074
02:42:31.720 --> 02:42:35.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napaka-daming underground water doon galing sa Lake Imelda.

asr-003075
02:42:35.400 --> 02:42:36.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I am a witness to that.

asr-003076
02:42:36.940 --> 02:42:41.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So kung environmentally friendly naman yung extraction,

asr-003077
02:42:41.900 --> 02:42:42.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: walang problema yan.

asr-003078
02:42:42.540 --> 02:42:46.390
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tulungan natin yung Ormoc, yung mga water permit nila.

asr-003079
02:42:46.390 --> 02:42:51.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siguro matagal na yan na

asr-003080
02:42:51.400 --> 02:42:54.510
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: wala pang water permit.

asr-003081
02:42:54.520 --> 02:42:57.800
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Meron kaming water permit, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003082
02:42:58.280 --> 02:43:01.920
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Well, one of the problems we have in Ormoc City is that we have abundance of water.

asr-003083
02:43:02.100 --> 02:43:06.040
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Our problem is ang outflow niya goes to the other side of Leyte.

asr-003084
02:43:06.560 --> 02:43:09.080
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Seven towns ang benefit doon.

asr-003085
02:43:09.080 --> 02:43:09.800
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I know that.

asr-003086
02:43:10.160 --> 02:43:15.720
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: More than 100,000 cubic meters per minute ang lumalabas diyan.

asr-003087
02:43:16.100 --> 02:43:18.380
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Grabe yung aquifer diyan galing sa Lake Imelda.

asr-003088
02:43:18.920 --> 02:43:25.620
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: So anyway, let's help the city of Ormoc become more environmentally friendly to everyone.

asr-003089
02:43:25.860 --> 02:43:26.680
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003090
02:43:26.820 --> 02:43:27.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Rep. Gomez.

asr-003091
02:43:27.980 --> 02:43:29.600
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003092
02:43:30.200 --> 02:43:34.680
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Actually, yes, Mayor Lucy called yesterday.

asr-003093
02:43:34.680 --> 02:43:38.500
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: She said she would send something in writing on their concerns.

asr-003094
02:43:38.800 --> 02:43:44.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I think she mentioned also illegal logging, like you mentioned, Mr. Chair, today.

asr-003095
02:43:44.760 --> 02:43:52.740
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: With regard to the water concern, they're not under the water district, as mentioned.

asr-003096
02:43:53.020 --> 02:43:53.320
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: No.

asr-003097
02:43:53.400 --> 02:44:04.340
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: But the Water Resource Management Office is under the DNR by virtue of an executive order issued by the President in 2023.

asr-003098
02:44:04.340 --> 02:44:05.400
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes.

asr-003099
02:44:05.400 --> 02:44:07.320
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, along with NWRB,

asr-003101
02:44:07.400 --> 02:44:09.630
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: we will see how we can assist the city of Ormoc.

asr-003101-split-2
02:44:09.630 --> 02:44:11.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: City of Ormoc

asr-003103
02:44:11.860 --> 02:44:12.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay.

asr-003104
02:44:12.380 --> 02:44:12.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-003106
02:44:12.840 --> 02:44:13.680
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003107
02:44:13.920 --> 02:44:19.486
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I'd like to invite also the good secretary to please come to Ormoc so that we can share our best practices.

asr-003108
02:44:19.486 --> 02:44:20.144
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes.

asr-003109
02:44:20.180 --> 02:44:20.840
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you.

asr-003110
02:44:20.880 --> 02:44:21.680
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

