DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, shall I respond already?

asr-003304
02:55:33.100 --> 02:55:33.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Not yet.

asr-003305
02:55:33.820 --> 02:55:35.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please, answer number two.

asr-003306
