DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: With regard to number two, Mr. Chair, the DNR is going to submit a full report of all the operations we have conducted on illegal mining involving Chinese nationals in different regions, Mr. Chair.

asr-003307
02:55:45.900 --> 02:55:55.320
