asr-003738
03:15:19.620 --> 03:15:24.960
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: For the first 30 days, in fact, we're supposed to be coming up with a critical minerals list.

asr-003739
03:15:25.500 --> 03:15:32.700
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: And that critical minerals list would now define which projects would now be covered by this particular executive order.

asr-003740
03:15:32.980 --> 03:15:41.400
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: And we have something like, in fact, Mr. Chairman, prior to the President signing this executive order,

asr-003741
03:15:41.520 --> 03:15:45.940
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: we have done our work already ahead of it, anticipating that it would be signed.

asr-003742
03:15:45.940 --> 03:15:56.900
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: Primarily because there is really a need for us to have a unified, structured, directional strategy on how we can mine our critical minerals.

asr-003743
03:15:57.680 --> 03:15:58.380
DENR Assistant Secretary for Mining Concerns Michael V. Cabalda: Thank you.

asr-003744
03:15:59.000 --> 03:15:59.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sige.

asr-003745
03:16:01.200 --> 03:16:04.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kong, I'm sorry, but you only asked for one question.

asr-003746
03:16:04.440 --> 03:16:08.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So please submit your policy direction towards that.

asr-003747
03:16:08.400 --> 03:16:15.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And next on the list is from our minority, Congresswoman Atty. Renee Co.

asr-003748
03:16:15.320 --> 03:16:17.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ma'am, you have the floor.

asr-003749
03:16:17.160 --> 03:16:22.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Chair, at good afternoon po sa Department of Environment and Natural Resources.

asr-003750
03:16:23.600 --> 03:16:35.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Didiretso na rin ako, dahil ang pansin naman namin sa budget proposal ninyo ay to conduct EIAs ay meron po kayong P251 million.

asr-003751
03:16:35.760 --> 03:16:36.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Correct po ba?

asr-003752
03:16:37.720 --> 03:16:40.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Environmental Impact Assessment. Para po magawa siya.

asr-003753
03:16:41.080 --> 03:16:41.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: P251 million.

asr-003754
03:16:43.740 --> 03:16:46.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And this is national, no? Tama po ba?

asr-003755
03:16:48.785 --> 03:16:51.620
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: [unclear] We're just checking, Mr. Chair.

asr-003757
03:16:51.800 --> 03:16:52.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay, sige.

asr-003758
03:16:53.040 --> 03:17:07.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero kaya naman nga po tinatanong natin dahil critical yung work ng DNR sa pag-ensure na kung ano pong mga plano ay hindi po ito makakasagabal, makakapinsala sa kalikasan.

asr-003759
03:17:07.360 --> 03:17:13.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ang malaking usapin po sa ganito ay yung Pax Silica, no?

asr-003760
03:17:14.020 --> 03:17:17.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Isa po siya sa nakikita na may epekto.

asr-003761
03:17:17.820 --> 03:17:21.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito sa ecosystems, water supplies, energy supplies sa ating bansa.

asr-003762
03:17:21.600 --> 03:17:28.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sinisimula na nga po sa Capas, Tarlac yung pagkuha ng mga lupa ng mga lokal na komunidad na nakatira doon.

asr-003763
03:17:28.760 --> 03:17:42.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, my question, given na urgent ito, mukhang priority project po ng PBBM administration, may natapos na po bang environmental impact assessment tungkol po sa Pax Silica?

asr-003764
03:17:42.340 --> 03:17:46.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And ang na-note po ng DTI sa ibang mga briefings, no?

asr-003765
03:17:46.520 --> 03:17:47.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala.

asr-003766
03:17:47.800 --> 03:17:48.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala pa.

asr-003767
03:17:48.740 --> 03:17:50.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I hear that on the record po?

asr-003768
03:17:51.020 --> 03:17:52.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-003769
03:17:52.780 --> 03:17:53.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please go ahead.

asr-003770
03:17:54.400 --> 03:18:03.040
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: There has been no environmental impact assessment applied for or processed, Mr. Chair, at this time.

asr-003771
03:18:03.120 --> 03:18:10.020
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: In fact, there's no clear project description actually that we are aware of at this time.

asr-003772
03:18:10.200 --> 03:18:15.980
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, for us to be able to intelligently assess,

asr-003773
03:18:15.980 --> 03:18:22.080
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: any environmental impact, the project description should be clear.

asr-003774
03:18:22.080 --> 03:18:28.760
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: But as of now, there has been none that has been submitted to the EMB, Mr. Chair.

asr-003775
03:18:29.140 --> 03:18:29.780
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Wala pa.

asr-003776
03:18:30.180 --> 03:18:30.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please go ahead.

asr-003777
03:18:31.280 --> 03:18:37.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil po, nung July 23, ang BCDA, sabi niya po na may master plan sila.

asr-003778
03:18:37.220 --> 03:18:40.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At inaprubahan na raw po ng DNR yung master plan na ito.

asr-003779
03:18:41.080 --> 03:18:42.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, is that true, Mr. Chair?

asr-003780
03:18:43.640 --> 03:18:44.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sige, sabi lang nila yun.

asr-003781
03:18:45.040 --> 03:18:45.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: EMB?

asr-003782
03:18:45.480 --> 03:18:47.760
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, if I may...

asr-003783
03:18:47.760 --> 03:18:53.400
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I defer to Attorney Mike Matias, if there is such a plan that we were involved in.

asr-003784
03:18:53.620 --> 03:18:54.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Attorney Mike?

asr-003785
03:18:57.840 --> 03:19:09.140
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Mr. Chair, I think the good Congresswoman is referring to the approved ECC that was issued for the development plan of the BCDA,

asr-003786
03:19:09.140 --> 03:19:11.060
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: which covers the entire area.

asr-003787
03:19:11.240 --> 03:19:19.220
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: But if we're going to look at yung projects, sir, as mentioned in the reports, yung 1,600 hectares,

asr-003788
03:19:19.340 --> 03:19:24.880
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: wala pa pong specific projects that will be located po dun sa area.

asr-003789
03:19:25.560 --> 03:19:30.100
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, may ECC na, pero wala pang Environmental Impact Assistant?

asr-003790
03:19:32.780 --> 03:19:38.940
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Ang mangyayari po dyan, sir, if there will be applications for projects within that 1,600,

asr-003791
03:19:39.320 --> 03:19:42.060
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: then they will be required to undergo an EIA.

asr-003792
03:19:42.060 --> 03:19:47.080
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, they will be required to secure an ECC for that specific project.

asr-003793
03:19:47.340 --> 03:19:48.520
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: For example po, may nauna.

asr-003794
03:19:48.660 --> 03:19:51.140
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Um, um, um, factory.

asr-003795
03:19:51.920 --> 03:19:56.860
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Ang assessment po na gagawin natin, when they file an application for ECC for that factory,

asr-003796
03:19:57.520 --> 03:20:02.800
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: we will, it will undergo consultation and environmental impact assessment of that particular.

asr-003797
03:20:03.080 --> 03:20:07.960
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: And if subsequently po, kasi ang pagkakaintindi po namin,

asr-003798
03:20:08.340 --> 03:20:12.700
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: yung mga locators po dito, hindi siya pare-pareho, sabay-sabay na darating eh.

asr-003799
03:20:12.820 --> 03:20:18.920
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, pag may susunod po, i-assess po namin yung environmental impact of that subsequent project,

asr-003800
03:20:18.920 --> 03:20:22.900
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: in relation to that existing project that has already been covered by an EIA.

asr-003801
03:20:23.160 --> 03:20:27.440
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, ito po yung cumulative impact assessment na gagawin natin,

asr-003802
03:20:27.440 --> 03:20:33.500
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: so that all the impacts of those locators within that 1,600 hectares will be considered.

asr-003803
03:20:33.500 --> 03:20:39.280
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: So, dahil, ayun, parang tingi-tingi na papasok ganyan,

asr-003804
03:20:39.340 --> 03:20:44.800
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: wala pong pangkabuuang EIA na ginagawa ngayon yung DENR.

asr-003805
03:20:44.920 --> 03:20:46.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po ba dapat meron?

asr-003806
03:20:47.040 --> 03:20:48.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Supposedly, may master plan.

asr-003807
03:20:48.600 --> 03:20:52.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May mga locations, meron pong, hindi nga lang daw po ito New Clark City,

asr-003808
03:20:52.380 --> 03:20:57.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: according to the PTI-BOI, pero other parts of the country po.

asr-003809
03:20:57.280 --> 03:20:59.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Alam po ba ito ng DNR?

asr-003810
03:20:59.460 --> 03:21:01.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And meron po ba siyang pinaplano?

asr-003811
03:21:01.100 --> 03:21:05.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or may environmental management plan po ba na in the works sa DNR?

asr-003812
03:21:06.280 --> 03:21:07.520
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you, Congresswoman.

asr-003813
03:21:08.400 --> 03:21:11.580
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Ang pag-assess po natin ng environmental impact,

asr-003814
03:21:11.900 --> 03:21:16.080
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: we'll have to know first kung ano po yung mga specific projects na ilalagay.

asr-003815
03:21:16.180 --> 03:21:18.660
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So that we will understand, for example,

asr-003816
03:21:19.140 --> 03:21:21.380
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: the water requirement, kung meron po ito,

asr-003817
03:21:21.400 --> 03:21:22.700
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: electricity requirement.

asr-003818
03:21:22.700 --> 03:21:26.480
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Then, on the basis of that, as mentioned by the legal secretary,

asr-003819
03:21:26.800 --> 03:21:28.120
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: yung ating project description,

asr-003820
03:21:28.480 --> 03:21:32.020
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: i-assess po natin what are the impacts po

asr-003821
03:21:32.020 --> 03:21:34.400
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: nung mga activities na yun.

asr-003822
03:21:34.580 --> 03:21:37.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Right now po, we do not have that specifics

asr-003823
03:21:37.060 --> 03:21:42.800
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: so that we cannot properly have this environmental management plan

asr-003824
03:21:42.800 --> 03:21:44.860
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: to address those anticipated impacts.

asr-003825
03:21:45.180 --> 03:21:48.400
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So once we get hold of those information po,

asr-003826
03:21:48.460 --> 03:21:51.860
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: that's why we're coordinating then with the BCDA,

asr-003827
03:21:52.280 --> 03:21:56.900
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: para at least yung mga anticipated impacts ng mga proposed projects.

asr-003828
03:21:57.060 --> 03:22:00.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: But to set the record straight po,

asr-003829
03:22:00.180 --> 03:22:04.260
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: as of now, wala pa po tayong specific projects na ilalagay po.

asr-003830
03:22:04.360 --> 03:22:06.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So to clarify po, Mr. Chair,

asr-003831
03:22:06.500 --> 03:22:10.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po yung na-issuehan nyo ng ECC?

asr-003832
03:22:10.620 --> 03:22:13.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung wala pang mga projects na aware yung DNR,

asr-003833
03:22:13.940 --> 03:22:17.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: wala pang EIA na alam or ginagawa,

asr-003834
03:22:17.480 --> 03:22:18.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po?

asr-003835
03:22:18.340 --> 03:22:19.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano ba yan, Mr. Chair?

asr-003836
03:22:20.700 --> 03:22:26.180
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Ang issue ones po natin would be for the development of that area

asr-003837
03:22:26.180 --> 03:22:28.480
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: within the Clark City.

asr-003838
03:22:28.800 --> 03:22:31.320
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: And that would include po yung mga road networks,

asr-003839
03:22:31.760 --> 03:22:33.820
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: yun lang po ang iko-cover nun.

asr-003840
03:22:33.940 --> 03:22:38.180
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: But as to the specific impacts of the projects that will be put there,

asr-003841
03:22:38.300 --> 03:22:39.200
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: wala pa po tayo.

asr-003842
03:22:39.260 --> 03:22:42.880
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: And rest assured that should there be any projects po,

asr-003843
03:22:43.000 --> 03:22:45.920
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: dadaan po ito sa EIA process,

asr-003844
03:22:46.060 --> 03:22:48.720
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: which includes consultation and public hearings.

asr-003845
03:22:49.180 --> 03:22:51.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang narinig ko rin po kanina, Mr. Chair,

asr-003846
03:22:51.840 --> 03:22:54.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na bagong mag-issue ng ECC, dapat may consultations.

asr-003847
03:22:55.260 --> 03:22:58.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang report on the ground ay hindi naman po na-consult

asr-003848
03:22:58.100 --> 03:23:02.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga communities na ma-apektohan sa New Clark City,

asr-003849
03:23:02.520 --> 03:23:06.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa Capas, tungkol po sa gagawing Pax Silica initiative.

asr-003850
03:23:06.900 --> 03:23:08.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So bakit po may ECC na?

asr-003851
03:23:10.720 --> 03:23:16.820
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Ang pagkakaintindi, although the regional director can provide details po,

asr-003852
03:23:16.820 --> 03:23:18.140
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: but ang understanding,

asr-003853
03:23:19.060 --> 03:23:24.320
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: yung area ng Pax Silica is just part of the total area of the...

asr-003854
03:23:24.320 --> 03:23:25.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Total 1,600 hectares?

asr-003855
03:23:25.820 --> 03:23:28.180
EMB Director Michael Drake P. Matias: Yung 1,600 hectares is part of the...

asr-003856
03:23:28.180 --> 03:23:31.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi in fact, yung Pax Silica, wala pang application yun,

asr-003857
03:23:31.860 --> 03:23:36.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: wala pang katiyakan kung ano talagang mga factories ang lalagay nila doon.

asr-003858
03:23:36.080 --> 03:23:36.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Gano'n ba yun?

asr-003859
03:23:37.280 --> 03:23:38.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nasaan yung RD?

asr-003860
03:23:38.320 --> 03:23:38.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, sir.

asr-003861
03:23:39.180 --> 03:23:39.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nandyan?

asr-003862
03:23:40.000 --> 03:23:42.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lapitan mo, sagutin mo si Congresswoman Co.

asr-003863
03:23:42.940 --> 03:23:53.720
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Cong, magandang hapon po, Mr. Chair, for the question. To set the record straight, tama po na mayroong ECC yung master plan po ng New Clark City.

asr-003867
03:23:53.920 --> 03:23:56.380
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: This is about 9,400 hectares po.

asr-003868
03:23:56.540 --> 03:23:56.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Industrial?

asr-003869
03:23:57.500 --> 03:24:00.400
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Yes, sir. May mga zoning po na inindicate doon.

asr-003870
03:24:00.440 --> 03:24:07.020
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Either commercial, mayroon pong pang-residential, mayroon pong pang-open parks, and so on.

asr-003871
03:24:07.180 --> 03:24:07.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 9,000?

asr-003872
03:24:08.000 --> 03:24:09.080
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: 400, sir.

asr-003873
03:24:09.640 --> 03:24:13.020
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Ito po yung kabuuan ng New Clark City.

asr-003874
03:24:13.600 --> 03:24:17.400
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Ngayon po, doon po sa area ng 1,600 hectares,

asr-003875
03:24:17.500 --> 03:24:20.100
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: base po doon sa master plan nila.

asr-003876
03:24:20.200 --> 03:24:22.340
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Wala pa pong nakalagay po doon.

asr-003877
03:24:22.340 --> 03:24:25.480
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: So ito po, magiging subject po ito ng another EIA.

asr-003878
03:24:25.740 --> 03:24:26.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Another one.

asr-003879
03:24:27.080 --> 03:24:29.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, thank you po sa pag-clarify.

asr-003880
03:24:30.760 --> 03:24:33.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nakonsulta na po ba kayo ng BCDA or kung sino man,

asr-003881
03:24:34.120 --> 03:24:38.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung saan po masasource yung tubig for the Pax Silica Manufacturing Hub

asr-003882
03:24:38.420 --> 03:24:40.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or kung ano man po yung gustong iplano doon?

asr-003883
03:24:40.440 --> 03:24:45.100
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: As previously mentioned po, wala pa pong konkretong detalye na nasusumiti po sa atin.

asr-003884
03:24:45.160 --> 03:24:48.220
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: In fact, yung EIA process po natin,

asr-003885
03:24:48.240 --> 03:24:53.280
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: hindi pa po nagsisimula dahil wala pa pong konkretong mga detalye doon.

asr-003886
03:24:53.280 --> 03:24:58.680
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Pero sa ngayon po, mayroon pong mga coordination just to brief us

asr-003887
03:24:58.680 --> 03:25:00.980
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: on what potentially could be the project.

asr-003888
03:25:01.020 --> 03:25:05.840
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Kasi wala pa rin pong malinaw na locators kung sino ang pupuesto doon.

asr-003889
03:25:05.840 --> 03:25:09.440
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Kasi ngayon po, puro intent pa lang po din ang nakukuha ni BCDA

asr-003890
03:25:09.440 --> 03:25:13.380
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: from other potential locators according po sa information nila.

asr-003891
03:25:13.480 --> 03:25:17.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, since sabi po ng DENR,

asr-003892
03:25:17.380 --> 03:25:19.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: wala pa, ang tanong ko na lang po and request,

asr-003893
03:25:19.980 --> 03:25:25.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pwede po bang may written opinion ang DNR na ma-accomplish

asr-003894
03:25:25.360 --> 03:25:31.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on the environmental effects of a data center or a semiconductor manufacturing hub?

asr-003895
03:25:31.520 --> 03:25:33.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya po ba yun na ma-accomplish?

asr-003896
03:25:34.020 --> 03:25:39.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, hopefully before plenary po, para po ito na yung panimula kung ano man gagawin EIA.

asr-003897
03:25:39.460 --> 03:25:40.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pong application eh.

asr-003898
03:25:41.260 --> 03:25:45.160
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Mr. Chair, yun nga po yung lalamanin ng ating EIA.

asr-003899
03:25:45.380 --> 03:25:47.740
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: So, we would not like to preempt po sana

asr-003900
03:25:47.740 --> 03:25:51.240
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: yung magiging pag-conduct po ng EIA natin

asr-003901
03:25:51.240 --> 03:25:54.660
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: because everything would be dependent on the study to be conducted po.

asr-003902
03:25:54.780 --> 03:25:59.820
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: But, rest assured ho, yung mga requirement ho ninyo on public participation, consultation,

asr-003903
03:26:00.720 --> 03:26:03.240
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: part ho ito ng proseso na dapat ho talagang gawin.

asr-003904
03:26:03.400 --> 03:26:05.600
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: At sisiguraduin ho natin na hindi ho,

asr-003905
03:26:05.720 --> 03:26:09.460
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: kumbaga meron din ho social acceptability yan at kasama din ho doon

asr-003906
03:26:09.460 --> 03:26:12.940
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: kung ano ho yung pinaplano ng proponent na dapat niyang gawin

asr-003907
03:26:12.940 --> 03:26:16.240
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: para ho doon sa mga kababayan natin na maapektuhan doon sa lugar.

asr-003908
03:26:16.520 --> 03:26:17.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But this won't be,

asr-003909
03:26:17.380 --> 03:26:18.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pre-empting it,

asr-003910
03:26:18.240 --> 03:26:19.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I think, Mr. Chair,

asr-003911
03:26:19.820 --> 03:26:21.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sige, yung EIA pwede pong i-accomplish

asr-003912
03:26:21.960 --> 03:26:25.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ano man po yung study na kailangan i-accomplish.

asr-003913
03:26:25.320 --> 03:26:26.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero this one,

asr-003914
03:26:27.300 --> 03:26:29.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may data centers na po ba dito?

asr-003915
03:26:29.120 --> 03:26:30.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May manufacturing hubs na po ba dito?

asr-003916
03:26:30.780 --> 03:26:32.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This would be a written opinion lang.

asr-003917
03:26:32.280 --> 03:26:36.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano yung pwedeng effects environmentally neto?

asr-003918
03:26:36.340 --> 03:26:37.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po ba yun, Mr. Chair?

asr-003919
03:26:37.900 --> 03:26:41.700
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Mr. Chair, I think we can provide whatever information we have

asr-003920
03:26:41.700 --> 03:26:43.080
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: kung anong existing natin.

asr-003921
03:26:43.140 --> 03:26:44.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Basta may application na yung facility.

asr-003922
03:26:44.820 --> 03:26:46.540
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: Basta meron tayong konkretong information po.

asr-003923
03:26:46.920 --> 03:26:50.340
DENR-EMB Region 3 Director Martin Jose V. Despi: We will try our best, ma'am, to provide the needed information if we have it.

asr-003924
03:26:50.480 --> 03:26:52.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay. And kaya po ba before plenary, Mr. Chair?

asr-003925
03:26:54.820 --> 03:26:56.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In addition to that,

asr-003926
03:26:56.680 --> 03:26:59.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: in addition to that for the information of the public,

asr-003927
03:26:59.440 --> 03:27:01.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yun namang Pax Silica,

asr-003928
03:27:02.000 --> 03:27:03.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: this is a chance in a lifetime.

asr-003929
03:27:04.060 --> 03:27:08.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At yung tinatakot natin na 60 million liters

asr-003930
03:27:08.660 --> 03:27:10.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ang kailangan sa isang araw,

asr-003931
03:27:10.620 --> 03:27:15.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung i-combine mo yung discharge ng all Zambales rivers

asr-003932
03:27:15.680 --> 03:27:17.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: into the ocean,

asr-003933
03:27:17.260 --> 03:27:21.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: every second is equivalent to that 60 million liters.

asr-003934
03:27:21.500 --> 03:27:24.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's only equivalent to 60,000 cubic meters,

asr-003935
03:27:25.120 --> 03:27:26.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: which is one panamax.

asr-003936
03:27:26.800 --> 03:27:28.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Parang itong building na ito.

asr-003937
03:27:28.080 --> 03:27:31.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yan lang ang per second na lumalabas sa lahat ng ilog na Zambales.

asr-003938
03:27:31.560 --> 03:27:34.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya huwag matakot yung ating publiko dito sa Pax Silica.

asr-003939
03:27:35.900 --> 03:27:39.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Just a small information.

asr-003940
03:27:39.880 --> 03:27:43.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi water is my forte,

asr-003941
03:27:43.820 --> 03:27:47.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and 60 million liters is only,

asr-003942
03:27:47.060 --> 03:27:49.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 60,000 cubic meters,

asr-003943
03:27:49.720 --> 03:27:51.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: that is only one panamax.

asr-003944
03:27:51.500 --> 03:27:53.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: E maliit po yung 60 million liters

asr-003945
03:27:53.620 --> 03:27:56.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: compared to all the rivers in Zambales

asr-003946
03:27:57.260 --> 03:27:58.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: discharging to the ocean

asr-003947
03:27:58.360 --> 03:27:59.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: that's only one second.

asr-003948
03:28:00.300 --> 03:28:01.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ganun po.

asr-003949
03:28:01.800 --> 03:28:03.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya huwag matakot yung ating public

asr-003950
03:28:03.520 --> 03:28:04.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: sa Pax Silica.

asr-003951
03:28:04.900 --> 03:28:07.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: This is a chance in a lifetime.

asr-003952
03:28:07.480 --> 03:28:09.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: We must get this.

asr-003953
03:28:09.240 --> 03:28:09.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-003954
03:28:09.980 --> 03:28:11.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please go ahead.

asr-003955
03:28:11.260 --> 03:28:12.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you po, Mr. Chair.

asr-003956
03:28:12.480 --> 03:28:14.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero with all due respect po,

asr-003957
03:28:14.100 --> 03:28:16.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: marami pong may concern sa Pax Silica

asr-003958
03:28:16.460 --> 03:28:17.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil,

asr-003959
03:28:17.200 --> 03:28:18.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: aside from tubig,

asr-003960
03:28:18.440 --> 03:28:19.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa kuryente,

asr-003961
03:28:19.340 --> 03:28:20.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa lupa,

asr-003962
03:28:20.280 --> 03:28:22.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: marami pong compounded concerns yan.

asr-003963
03:28:22.200 --> 03:28:23.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And we're looking at DNR

asr-003964
03:28:23.340 --> 03:28:26.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to resolve some of these concerns.

asr-003965
03:28:26.560 --> 03:28:27.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And so,

asr-003966
03:28:27.460 --> 03:28:28.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung concerns naman po ito,

asr-003967
03:28:28.800 --> 03:28:30.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi ito in a vacuum lang.

asr-003968
03:28:30.620 --> 03:28:32.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Everywhere else in the world,

asr-003969
03:28:32.380 --> 03:28:34.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may mga concerns na po on data centers.

asr-003970
03:28:34.640 --> 03:28:36.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I'll just cite a few studies, no?

asr-003971
03:28:36.660 --> 03:28:37.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, for example,

asr-003972
03:28:38.140 --> 03:28:38.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa US,

asr-003973
03:28:39.180 --> 03:28:41.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa Amazon's Canton Facility, Mississippi,

asr-003974
03:28:42.220 --> 03:28:43.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang sabi po,

asr-003975
03:28:43.320 --> 03:28:44.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we were promised prosperity

asr-003976
03:28:44.760 --> 03:28:47.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: but got poisoned air and vanishing water.

asr-003977
03:28:47.340 --> 03:28:48.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May class action na po

asr-003978
03:28:48.400 --> 03:28:49.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: since February 2026

asr-003979
03:28:49.780 --> 03:28:51.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for Clean Water Act violations.

asr-003980
03:28:51.760 --> 03:28:53.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa Monterey Park Data Center,

asr-003981
03:28:53.760 --> 03:28:56.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hyperscale facility ng EDGE Corps in California,

asr-003982
03:28:57.420 --> 03:28:59.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: environmental colonialism daw,

asr-003983
03:28:59.100 --> 03:28:59.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi innovation,

asr-003984
03:29:00.060 --> 03:29:01.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and 3,000 signatures

asr-003985
03:29:01.380 --> 03:29:03.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and testimony of farm workers

asr-003986
03:29:03.620 --> 03:29:05.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na naapektuhan ng crop damaging runoff

asr-003987
03:29:05.960 --> 03:29:06.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang nangyari.

asr-003988
03:29:06.400 --> 03:29:07.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I could go on,

asr-003989
03:29:07.100 --> 03:29:08.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero saglit lang po yung oras ko.

asr-003990
03:29:08.440 --> 03:29:08.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair,

asr-003991
03:29:09.300 --> 03:29:10.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang punto naman po

asr-003992
03:29:10.120 --> 03:29:11.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng ginagawa natin,

asr-003993
03:29:11.300 --> 03:29:13.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may valid concerns ang mamamayan.

asr-003994
03:29:13.860 --> 03:29:16.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Narinig din po natin sa DTI kahapon

asr-003995
03:29:16.020 --> 03:29:16.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na hindi po,

asr-003996
03:29:16.820 --> 03:29:20.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nila masabi na wala pong data center

asr-003997
03:29:20.060 --> 03:29:21.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na maaaring matayo sa New Clark City.

asr-003998
03:29:22.240 --> 03:29:24.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May manufacturing hub na iniisip

asr-003999
03:29:24.360 --> 03:29:26.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero data center not off the table.

asr-004000
03:29:26.420 --> 03:29:27.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, ako po,

asr-004001
03:29:27.880 --> 03:29:30.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung may maisasumite po yung DNR

asr-004002
03:29:30.420 --> 03:29:32.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na information tungkol po

asr-004003
03:29:32.380 --> 03:29:34.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa environmental impact

asr-004004
03:29:34.180 --> 03:29:36.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng isang data center

asr-004005
03:29:36.460 --> 03:29:37.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng manufacturing hub,

asr-004006
03:29:37.820 --> 03:29:40.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: this representation would appreciate it po.

asr-004007
03:29:40.280 --> 03:29:41.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sige, yun po muna

asr-004008
03:29:41.680 --> 03:29:43.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and siguro yung next question ko na lang po

asr-004009
03:29:43.760 --> 03:29:44.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nasimulan na po kanina

asr-004010
03:29:44.940 --> 03:29:46.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung tungkol po sa

asr-004011
03:29:46.000 --> 03:29:46.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Executive

asr-004012
03:29:46.340 --> 03:29:48.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Order No. 122

asr-004013
03:29:48.840 --> 03:29:49.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: which is

asr-004014
03:29:49.540 --> 03:29:53.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: tungkol po sa Critical Minerals Framework ng Pilipinas.

asr-004015
03:29:53.520 --> 03:29:56.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So ang narinig po natin, according to this,

asr-004016
03:29:56.740 --> 03:30:02.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay may 9 million hectares na prospective areas

asr-004017
03:30:02.020 --> 03:30:04.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with potential to hold various mineral resources.

asr-004018
03:30:05.420 --> 03:30:10.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So I'd like to ask po sa DNR and sa MGB

asr-004019
03:30:10.400 --> 03:30:13.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil po kasi sila yung tinitignan

asr-004020
03:30:13.760 --> 03:30:18.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na mag-implement ng National Exploration and Mineral Reservation Program

asr-004021
03:30:18.060 --> 03:30:21.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to identify and evaluate new critical mineral deposits.

asr-004022
03:30:21.540 --> 03:30:26.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano na pong mga aksyon or karampatang preliminary steps

asr-004023
03:30:26.320 --> 03:30:29.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po i-implement na yung EO-122?

asr-004024
03:30:30.200 --> 03:30:33.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's the last question, Sec. Will you please reply?

asr-004025
03:30:34.320 --> 03:30:35.840
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Director Larry, please.

asr-004026
03:30:38.560 --> 03:30:43.500
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung ating exploration program po sa MGB,

asr-004027
03:30:43.660 --> 03:30:44.820
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: continuing naman po yan.

asr-004028
03:30:45.860 --> 03:30:49.900
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung EO-122, as just highlighted po natin,

asr-004029
03:30:49.900 --> 03:30:55.540
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: to have a unified framework on how to develop yung critical minerals.

asr-004030
03:30:55.880 --> 03:30:59.060
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: But yung pong critical minerals, identified na po natin yan,

asr-004031
03:30:59.160 --> 03:31:01.340
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: which is gold, copper, nickel,

asr-004032
03:31:01.660 --> 03:31:03.200
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: na meron naman tayong data.

asr-004033
03:31:03.200 --> 03:31:06.580
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: And we are continuing to explore and find out

asr-004034
03:31:06.580 --> 03:31:09.280
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: where these minerals are located,

asr-004035
03:31:10.060 --> 03:31:15.120
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: if they are mine-feasible ba yung pagmumina doon sa kanila,

asr-004036
03:31:15.710 --> 03:31:17.740
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: yun po yung ginagawa ng MGB ngayon.

asr-004037
03:31:17.820 --> 03:31:19.780
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung critical minerals, highlights lang,

asr-004038
03:31:20.000 --> 03:31:23.920
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: na kung paano ang Pilipinas ay puposisyon

asr-004039
03:31:23.920 --> 03:31:28.420
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: doon sa rapidly increasing demand dito sa mga critical minerals.

asr-004040
03:31:28.720 --> 03:31:30.100
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Meron po tayong mga data niyan.

asr-004041
03:31:30.100 --> 03:31:33.720
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: And yung ibang lugar na ating ma-discover,

asr-004042
03:31:34.140 --> 03:31:36.820
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: maaari po din natin i-declare na mineral reservation

asr-004043
03:31:36.820 --> 03:31:39.340
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: because kung mineral reservation siya,

asr-004044
03:31:39.420 --> 03:31:43.180
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: may added premium po ang government for the royalty payment po.

asr-004045
03:31:43.180 --> 03:31:47.280
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: If ever, that mineral will be extracted and utilized.

asr-004046
03:31:48.000 --> 03:31:50.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, may follow-up question na lang po ako and manifestation.

asr-004047
03:31:50.800 --> 03:31:51.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Second round na lang tayo.

asr-004048
03:31:52.080 --> 03:31:52.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Isa na lang po.

asr-004049
03:31:53.020 --> 03:31:55.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil may tanong in relation po doon sa sinasabi.

asr-004050
03:31:55.980 --> 03:31:56.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: One minute.

asr-004051
03:31:56.920 --> 03:31:58.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004052
03:31:58.260 --> 03:32:00.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you for the indulgence, Mr. Chair.

asr-004053
03:32:00.720 --> 03:32:02.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung question naman po natin,

asr-004054
03:32:02.560 --> 03:32:04.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: una, pwede po bang makakuha ng copy

asr-004055
03:32:04.360 --> 03:32:08.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng sinabi na identified critical minerals na target?

asr-004056
03:32:09.180 --> 03:32:13.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil we're aware that meron po noong February 6

asr-004057
03:32:13.480 --> 03:32:17.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na tinirmahang Memorandum of Understanding

asr-004058
03:32:17.860 --> 03:32:19.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung United States and Philippines,

asr-004059
03:32:19.500 --> 03:32:21.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on critical minerals.

asr-004060
03:32:21.500 --> 03:32:23.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, syempre, we're left to wonder,

asr-004061
03:32:24.000 --> 03:32:27.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: itong EO, is this taking off from this MOU?

asr-004062
03:32:27.880 --> 03:32:29.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Today, we've seen many district representatives

asr-004063
03:32:29.840 --> 03:32:32.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: have a lot of concerns ng mining sa kanila.

asr-004064
03:32:32.400 --> 03:32:33.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ayaw na nila sa kanila,

asr-004065
03:32:33.500 --> 03:32:36.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or ayaw nila sa watersheds and critical areas nila.

asr-004066
03:32:36.800 --> 03:32:38.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But here, we have a directive na,

asr-004067
03:32:38.760 --> 03:32:40.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sige, mag-identify tayo,

asr-004068
03:32:40.260 --> 03:32:41.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: saan ba pwedeng pagminahan pa

asr-004069
03:32:41.780 --> 03:32:43.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa 9 million hectare prospective areas?

asr-004070
03:32:45.180 --> 03:32:46.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, I'd like to ask,

asr-004071
03:32:47.020 --> 03:32:49.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po ba yung effect ng Memorandum of Understanding?

asr-004072
03:32:49.680 --> 03:32:50.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ito sa EO?

asr-004073
03:32:50.840 --> 03:32:53.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang makareceive yung representation na ito

asr-004074
03:32:53.340 --> 03:32:54.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: through this committee,

asr-004075
03:32:54.200 --> 03:32:55.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: a copy of this MOU?

asr-004076
03:32:55.840 --> 03:32:58.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil may public interest involved na rin po dito,

asr-004077
03:32:58.460 --> 03:32:58.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair?

asr-004078
03:32:59.100 --> 03:33:01.040
