Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Next on the list

asr-004494
03:44:04.660 --> 03:44:06.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: is Rep. Gonzales.

asr-004495
03:44:08.200 --> 03:44:10.120
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-004498
03:44:10.660 --> 03:44:11.400
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At last,

asr-004499
03:44:14.320 --> 03:44:15.780
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: to the good secretary

asr-004500
03:44:15.780 --> 03:44:18.700
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: and the DENR family,

asr-004501
03:44:18.860 --> 03:44:19.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: good afternoon.

asr-004502
03:44:19.660 --> 03:44:20.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Good afternoon to my colleagues.

asr-004503
03:44:21.160 --> 03:44:23.120
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Before I will start my questioning,

asr-004505
03:44:23.360 --> 03:44:24.620
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I just would like to thank

asr-004506
03:44:24.620 --> 03:44:26.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: the Regional Office 8,

asr-004507
03:44:27.860 --> 03:44:28.380
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: DENR.

asr-004508
03:44:28.540 --> 03:44:30.220
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I would like to congratulate.

asr-004509
03:44:31.820 --> 03:44:43.380
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Salamat po sa binigay niyong mga data at makakapag-umpisa na po yung bill ko with regards to the issue about the timberland sa province po ng Eastern Samar.

asr-004518
03:44:43.620 --> 03:44:44.480
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004519
03:44:45.480 --> 03:44:56.900
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Anyway, this is all about a local concern in my province about the MPSA sa mga mining activity doon.

asr-004533
03:44:56.900 --> 03:45:05.860
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Mr. Chair, to the DENR family, siguro pwedeng isagutin po ng SEC, USEC, o kaya sa MGB Director.

asr-004534
03:45:08.020 --> 03:45:14.240
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam niyo po bang tungkol sa mining activity sa Homonhon Island, sa bayan ng Guiuan, Eastern Samar?

asr-004535
03:45:14.640 --> 03:45:18.000
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Humonon Island, favorite topic, please reply.

asr-004536
03:45:18.860 --> 03:45:19.920
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, yes po.

asr-004537
03:45:23.300 --> 03:45:26.960
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yung mga nag-ooperate po ba doon, may MPSA, sir?

asr-004538
03:45:28.240 --> 03:45:29.660
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Meron po, meron pong permit. Merong MPSA.

asr-004539
03:45:30.000 --> 03:45:34.320
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: May I ask po kung sino-sino mga nag-ooperate po doon?

asr-004540
03:45:35.760 --> 03:45:43.040
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Sa Humonon po, ang nag-ooperate po dyan ay yung dalawang MPSA contractor na

asr-004541
03:45:43.040 --> 03:45:57.320
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Nickel Ace at saka Chromite King, which for themselves, meron po silang mga operators. Ang mga operators po nila, yung Chromite King, ang operator niya is Tech Iron.

asr-004543
03:45:57.360 --> 03:46:05.540
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung Nickelace, may tatlong operator, Verum Terra, Pacific Nickel, and yung Global Minmet po.

asr-004544
03:46:05.660 --> 03:46:09.520
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung po yung mga nag-ooperate dyan sa dalawang MPSA.

asr-004545
03:46:09.860 --> 03:46:13.440
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Meron din pong nag-ooperate dyan na MPSA.

asr-004546
03:46:13.440 --> 03:46:21.000
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Kasi din po ang kontrata, which is Emir, certain Emir po, nag-ooperate dyan.

asr-004547
03:46:23.060 --> 03:46:26.700
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Tatlo lang, sir? Director? Mr. Chair?

asr-004548
03:46:29.360 --> 03:46:32.040
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Meron pong mga MPSA dyan po na hindi pa nag-ooperate.

asr-004549
03:46:32.080 --> 03:46:35.620
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Nag-ooperate po pero under suspension or suspended position.

asr-004550
03:46:35.620 --> 03:46:40.060
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ilan po ang na-issue-an po ng MPSA?

asr-004551
03:46:43.360 --> 03:46:46.400
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Apat po yata o lima. Hindi ko po manantandaan masyadong.

asr-004552
03:46:46.480 --> 03:46:46.660
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Okay.

asr-004553
03:46:46.660 --> 03:47:00.840
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: The Nickel Ace and Chromite King, kasi pinaghiwalay dalawa, sinabi niyo po, amended, na MPSA.

asr-004554
03:47:00.940 --> 03:47:06.640
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ano po ang pinanggalingan nito? Anong mining company po ang pinanggalingan nito?

asr-004555
03:47:06.880 --> 03:47:12.200
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Ang pinanggalingan po niya is another MPSA. Ang may hawak po niya yung Cambayas.

asr-004556
03:47:12.400 --> 03:47:12.820
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Okay.

asr-004557
03:47:12.960 --> 03:47:17.940
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Tapos doon po sa MPSA po kasi meron po din provision na decontract.

asr-004558
03:47:17.940 --> 03:47:28.840
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: May assign wholly or partially po yung MPSA nila, which later on, yung Cambayas po in-assign po niya sa Nickelace, yung other part.

asr-004559
03:47:29.180 --> 03:47:35.900
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: And earlier, na-assign din po niya doon sa Chromite King yung other half of the MPSA po.

asr-004560
03:47:36.460 --> 03:47:39.480
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Half of the MPSA. So Cambayas po nag-umpisa?

asr-004561
03:47:39.700 --> 03:47:41.900
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Doon po nag-umpisa yun, sa Cambayas MPSA.

asr-004562
03:47:42.080 --> 03:47:50.220
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kung mariricall niyo po ba anong taon nito na ibigay sa Cambayas? Kung mariricall niyo po ba? Kung hindi, I will just go on with my question here.

asr-004565
03:47:50.500 --> 03:47:51.760
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: MPSA po ang binigay natin.

asr-004566
03:47:51.760 --> 03:47:52.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yun nga po, anong taon po yan?

asr-004567
03:47:57.620 --> 03:47:59.400
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi ko po matandaan.

asr-004568
03:48:02.560 --> 03:48:09.360
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Okay. Anyway, area po, gaano kalaki yung Cambayas Mining? Before po ituhin natin, before na-amend yung MPSA?

asr-004569
03:48:14.920 --> 03:48:20.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meet mo na lang, Larry, yung buong humunhon, tapos yung mga dissection yan, mga pepagalan.

asr-004570
03:48:20.580 --> 03:48:24.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi, Mr. Chair, I've been asking this many times.

asr-004571
03:48:24.820 --> 03:48:27.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I feel, wala namang nangyayari.

asr-004572
03:48:27.600 --> 03:48:30.560
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Last time, if you could still recall, nag-interpelate po ako.

asr-004573
03:48:30.740 --> 03:48:36.360
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: But, siyempre, with my respect to the Honorable Gentleman, my idol, si Mr. Chair,

asr-004574
03:48:36.560 --> 03:48:40.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: hindi ko na po pinuruso kasi ang sabi, isasubmit naman po sa akin.

asr-004575
03:48:41.040 --> 03:48:44.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Larry, last chair mo pala ito. Can we do it by tomorrow?

asr-004576
03:48:44.900 --> 03:48:46.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil napapahiya yung inyong chair eh.

asr-004577
03:48:47.240 --> 03:48:47.860
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yes po.

asr-004578
03:48:47.860 --> 03:48:51.440
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yung buong humunhon, wala ko na pakindala dyan. Ang concern po ito.

asr-004580
03:48:52.220 --> 03:48:53.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Paprint mo nga yan?

asr-004581
03:48:55.140 --> 03:49:01.700
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Apo. Meron po ditong date, ano, yung original MPAC of Cambayas is 3,015 hectares.

asr-004583
03:49:01.700 --> 03:49:03.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Basta bigyan mo yan na nakalagay.

asr-004584
03:49:03.780 --> 03:49:04.760
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: The whole thing po.

asr-004585
03:49:04.940 --> 03:49:11.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: May color coding ka, sino yung nag-operate, sino yung hindi nag-operate, para may guide yung good congressman.

asr-004586
03:49:11.700 --> 03:49:13.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mahirap yun kung sa floor pa tayo mag-hidwaan.

asr-004587
03:49:13.600 --> 03:49:17.660
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yes. O, Mr. Chairman, we will submit po a complete CSW.

asr-004588
03:49:17.660 --> 03:49:19.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Can you do that by tomorrow?

asr-004589
03:49:20.020 --> 03:49:25.220
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi, yung mga constituents po, siyempre, Mr. Chair, parating tinatanong ako.

asr-004590
03:49:25.540 --> 03:49:30.000
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Eh, siyempre, first-termer ako. I have to deliver. Especially the tayang from that place.

asr-004591
03:49:30.200 --> 03:49:30.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Is tomorrow okay?

asr-004592
03:49:31.140 --> 03:49:32.260
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-004593
03:49:32.420 --> 03:49:33.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tomorrow, what time?

asr-004594
03:49:35.440 --> 03:49:37.200
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Early morning po, kung matapos po.

asr-004595
03:49:37.900 --> 03:49:38.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung matapos.

asr-004596
03:49:39.060 --> 03:49:40.000
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: This afternoon po.

asr-004597
03:49:40.740 --> 03:49:46.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Submit po sa committee, one copy. Diretso na sa opisina ni Rep. Gonzales yung isang kopya.

asr-004598
03:49:46.580 --> 03:49:47.480
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Opo, we'll do po.

asr-004599
03:49:48.260 --> 03:49:50.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Now you can proceed. You still have time.

asr-004600
03:49:50.380 --> 03:49:51.500
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Thank you, thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004601
03:49:51.780 --> 03:49:53.880
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Isang question ko po kasi dito, Mr. Chair.

asr-004602
03:49:54.160 --> 03:49:58.960
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: In as far as I know, that's why I want to discuss this.

asr-004604
03:50:00.140 --> 03:50:04.560
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yung isang MPSA, hinati po ito sa dalawa.

asr-004605
03:50:05.020 --> 03:50:08.100
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: In other words, meron po tayong Cambayas.

asr-004606
03:50:08.180 --> 03:50:09.960
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Isa-isang claim pa lang po ito, ha?

asr-004607
03:50:10.680 --> 03:50:11.080
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: In-assign.

asr-004608
03:50:11.420 --> 03:50:12.380
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: In-assign sa dalawa.

asr-004609
03:50:12.380 --> 03:50:21.700
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, merong amended na MPSA. Itong dalawang po ito, pwede namang i-operate kaagad.

asr-004611
03:50:22.100 --> 03:50:29.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Bakit pa, kung meron na kayong dalawa na MPSA, nagbigay pa sila ng operating agreement ulit under the NICL-A's.

asr-004613
03:50:30.160 --> 03:50:36.420
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: May apat, may tatlo ulit na contractor sila or operating agreement.

asr-004614
03:50:36.840 --> 03:50:37.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede ba yun Larry?

asr-004615
03:50:37.960 --> 03:50:40.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Why I ask this question, Mr. Chair?

asr-004616
03:50:41.100 --> 03:50:48.200
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi, paano kung merong mga illegal activities, yung operator na ito, yung tatlo,

asr-004617
03:50:48.340 --> 03:50:51.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: parang contractor, I mean parang MPSA,

asr-004618
03:50:52.800 --> 03:50:54.320
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: merong contractor.

asr-004619
03:50:54.520 --> 03:50:56.320
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: May another sub-contractor.

asr-004620
03:50:56.960 --> 03:51:04.140
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kung baga sa DPWH, may contractor ka na, may sinub-contract ka pa, may isa pang naka-level sa ilalim.

asr-004621
03:51:04.220 --> 03:51:10.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, kung pwede namang i-direct na ito, dinalawa na nga yung MPSA, pinaghati nyo na yung Cambayas.

asr-004622
03:51:11.440 --> 03:51:17.400
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: As far as I know, hinati nyo na yung Cambayas, dalawa ito, Nickelace at saka Chromite King.

asr-004623
03:51:18.280 --> 03:51:19.980
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Bakit ba yan, Larry? Bakit ba yan?

asr-004624
03:51:20.140 --> 03:51:24.760
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Under sa NICL-A's, Mr. Chair, meron pang operating agreement ulit.

asr-004625
03:51:25.220 --> 03:51:26.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sa tatlo, pwede namang i-direct na ito.

asr-004626
03:51:26.680 --> 03:51:27.940
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Why is it happening like this?

asr-004627
03:51:28.100 --> 03:51:34.400
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang mga tao ko nagtatanong, you know, I've six years po akong naging mayor sa town na yan.

asr-004628
03:51:35.040 --> 03:51:37.640
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi ko po ito masabi kasi wala naman akong data.

asr-004629
03:51:37.760 --> 03:51:40.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam nyo naman po ang mayor, hihingi ka lang ng business permit.

asr-004630
03:51:41.820 --> 03:51:44.940
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hihingan ka lang ng business permit, saka ka lang makikipagkita sa mga ganon.

asr-004631
03:51:45.040 --> 03:51:47.800
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: This is a large-scale mining, Mr. Chair.

asr-004632
03:51:47.980 --> 03:51:52.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, this time, salamat at nakakongressman ako at malalaman ko kung ano talaga.

asr-004633
03:51:52.920 --> 03:51:55.020
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang katutunan.

asr-004634
03:51:55.120 --> 03:51:59.980
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi, para nalang biglang may pumusulpot, may bago na namang mining company.

asr-004635
03:52:00.720 --> 03:52:06.900
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: If you divided that into two, dalawa ang inilagay nyo, or I mean, nahiwalay sila,

asr-004636
03:52:06.900 --> 03:52:08.960
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: ba't pa kayo mag-ooperating agreement?

asr-004637
03:52:10.320 --> 03:52:14.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Though, sabihin natin na legal yan. Yes, legal. Kasi batas.

asr-004638
03:52:14.300 --> 03:52:17.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang batas po, ginagawa para mapagaan ang buhay ng tao.

asr-004639
03:52:18.160 --> 03:52:22.160
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang batas po, ginagawa para maging okay ang kalagayan ng tao.

asr-004640
03:52:22.280 --> 03:52:24.420
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi po para ito ay abusuhin.

asr-004641
03:52:25.720 --> 03:52:26.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Larry?

asr-004642
03:52:28.840 --> 03:52:36.660
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Mr. Chair, precisely, yan pong case na po yan, na isang MPSA contractor,

asr-004643
03:52:36.660 --> 03:52:40.220
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: nag-engage siya ng a number of more than one operator.

asr-004644
03:52:40.220 --> 03:52:44.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sandali, sandali. Isang MPSA owner, hindi contractor.

asr-004645
03:52:44.000 --> 03:52:46.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi pinasubcontract niya kamo eh.

asr-004646
03:52:47.340 --> 03:52:48.480
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: MPSA owner po.

asr-004647
03:52:48.480 --> 03:52:49.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Owner? Okay.

asr-004648
03:52:50.540 --> 03:52:51.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sino yun?

asr-004649
03:52:52.300 --> 03:52:54.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sino yun? Chinese o Pilipino?

asr-004652
03:52:54.660 --> 03:52:56.800
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Nickel Expo is a Filipino corporation.

asr-004653
03:52:58.660 --> 03:52:59.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sigurado ka?

asr-004654
03:53:01.240 --> 03:53:03.220
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Hindi ko po ano. Yun po yung sinubmit.

asr-004656
03:53:07.200 --> 03:53:13.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yeah. Just one thing, Mr. Chair. Anyway, I will just register my second round of questioning.

asr-004657
03:53:13.280 --> 03:53:14.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi, hindi. You have time.

asr-004658
03:53:15.080 --> 03:53:15.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Go ahead, go ahead.

asr-004659
03:53:15.440 --> 03:53:19.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anyway, susubmit nila bukas.

asr-004655
03:53:16.610 --> 03:53:17.450
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Opo.

asr-004660
03:53:19.820 --> 03:53:21.680
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Susubmit po itong lahat.

asr-004661
03:53:21.800 --> 03:53:29.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And I will suggest na ikaw personally would go to his office at explain mo bakit maraming chop-chop yan.

asr-004664
03:53:30.060 --> 03:53:30.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Correct.

asr-004665
03:53:30.560 --> 03:53:36.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ano yun, si Brigada, pwede ba tulungan ninyo na nakikita mo ang daming operator doon eh.

asr-004666
03:53:37.420 --> 03:53:39.760
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Tama po yan. Ganito po ang itsura niyan.

asr-004667
03:53:40.620 --> 03:53:46.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sa pagka, para ma-ma-ma-ma-ma-ma-ma-ma-explain ko at ma-ma-ma-ma-internalize ng iba.

asr-004668
03:53:47.140 --> 03:53:51.100
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Para po kayong nasa palengke.

asr-004669
03:53:52.240 --> 03:53:56.480
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Binigyan ng rights na magtinda ang isang tindera sa palengke.

asr-004671
03:53:56.480 --> 03:53:57.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa pwesto.

asr-004672
03:53:57.260 --> 03:53:58.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sa pwesto.

asr-004673
03:53:58.460 --> 03:53:59.420
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hirap ng bisaya.

asr-004674
03:53:59.820 --> 03:54:04.020
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nakita po ito na malaki ang ibinigay ng gobyerno sa kanya.

asr-004675
03:54:04.140 --> 03:54:05.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oo. Pinarinstaan niya.

asr-004677
03:54:06.020 --> 03:54:06.240
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Okay.

asr-004678
03:54:06.340 --> 03:54:17.140
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang palengke, ang nagtitinda, sinabi niya ngayon na malaking pwesto ko, mag-i-invite ako para magtinda dito sa loob ng area ko.

asr-004679
03:54:17.780 --> 03:54:22.040
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Without knowing or without telling the government na nagtitinda ako.

asr-004680
03:54:22.080 --> 03:54:23.520
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sinabi lang sa market supervisor.

asr-004681
03:54:23.880 --> 03:54:25.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi doon sa local government unit.

asr-004682
03:54:25.720 --> 03:54:31.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Eh ngayon, nakapagtinda yung isang tindera doon, nakapagtinda ng panis na pagkain.

asr-004683
03:54:32.260 --> 03:54:35.000
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nung panis na pagkain, nagreklamo yung mga tao.

asr-004684
03:54:35.220 --> 03:54:43.260
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nung magreklamo yung mga tao, sinabi naman ng isa, yung mukha niya na nakadiretso sa LGU.

asr-004685
03:54:43.380 --> 03:54:45.820
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sinabi niya na, sige, alis ka dyan.

asr-004686
03:54:45.880 --> 03:54:48.860
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: O pinaalis yung nagtitinda ng panis.

asr-004687
03:54:48.880 --> 03:54:49.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala na.

asr-004688
03:54:49.120 --> 03:54:49.620
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi.

asr-004689
03:54:49.900 --> 03:54:51.480
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nag-invite na naman ulit siya.

asr-004690
03:54:51.620 --> 03:54:52.440
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Isa na naman.

asr-004691
03:54:52.440 --> 03:54:54.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Tapos, may nagtinda na naman ng panis.

asr-004692
03:54:54.560 --> 03:54:55.520
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Tanggal na na naman.

asr-004693
03:54:55.720 --> 03:55:03.440
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: And what I'm trying to say here, paano po makukontrol ng gobyerno pag mayroong ganito na napakarami nag-ooperate,

asr-004694
03:55:03.500 --> 03:55:06.660
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: hinatin nyo na yung MPSA, may operating agreement pa.

asr-004695
03:55:06.760 --> 03:55:10.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: What's the difference of operating agreement at saka deed of assignment?

asr-004696
03:55:12.160 --> 03:55:13.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Usec Fragada, can you answer that?

asr-004697
03:55:14.800 --> 03:55:16.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ikaw na nga, ikaw na nga.

asr-004698
03:55:16.680 --> 03:55:19.740
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Mr. Chair, good afternoon to the good congressman.

asr-004699
03:55:19.820 --> 03:55:21.940
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Actually, I'm aware po of that.

asr-004700
03:55:21.940 --> 03:55:27.180
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: That situation that the tenement is referring to.

asr-004701
03:55:27.320 --> 03:55:40.340
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: And last time we spoke, actually yesterday, sir, I shared the same sentiments po. Kasi ito pong mga hiwalayan ng MPSA, this was before our time. So, we're trying to find out all the...

asr-004704
03:55:40.340 --> 03:55:46.420
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yes, Mr. Chair. With due respect, hindi po ito panahon ni Secretary Mish. Mga sinauna po po ito.

asr-004707
03:55:46.420 --> 03:55:55.440
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Pero, I have an explanation, Mr. Chair. Yesterday, I met with all of them. With the Chromite King, Nickel Ace, and the operators.

asr-004710
03:55:55.440 --> 03:56:05.420
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: And first and foremost, I said that the concern of the department was for the affected communities in rehabilitation of this particular mining tenement.

asr-004712
03:56:05.740 --> 03:56:11.640
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: So, binigyan po namin sila ng palugit that within two months, mag-i-inspect, gawin po lahat ng mga...

asr-004714
03:56:11.660 --> 03:56:18.520
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Nagpa-investigan na po kasi tayo eh, dun sa mga violations or non-compliances, dun po sa area, sa tailings nila and everything.

asr-004717
03:56:18.900 --> 03:56:21.500
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: And yan pong naging focus and concentration.

asr-004718
03:56:21.500 --> 03:56:44.720
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: So, we gave them till October para ma-accomplish po ito habang tinitignan po namin yung concern ni Congressman regarding all the documents, why it led to MPSAs, to operators. So, yun po muna para... Kasi ang importante po sa amin yung rehab. Kasi sa dami po nila dyan, you have to make sure that the rehabilitation is done.

asr-004724
03:56:44.720 --> 03:56:50.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yusek, rehab at saka tamang contractor o tamang MPSA holder.

asr-004726
03:56:50.780 --> 03:56:51.940
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Napakarami po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004727
03:56:52.640 --> 03:56:53.080
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Napakarami.

asr-004728
03:56:53.300 --> 03:56:57.320
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Mayang-mayang, parang nalang lumalabas na parang kabuti na may nag-ooperate na naman dyan.

asr-004729
03:56:57.360 --> 03:56:58.020
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: What's happening?

asr-004730
03:56:58.220 --> 03:57:00.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napakaliit pa naman ng Homonhon

asr-004731
03:57:00.220 --> 03:57:00.900
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: May operating agreement.

asr-004732
03:57:01.480 --> 03:57:04.040
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: As much as we can, we're trying to fix that problem.

asr-004725
03:57:02.150 --> 03:57:02.810
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-004733
03:57:04.040 --> 03:57:04.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It's a shame to our history.

asr-004734
03:57:05.540 --> 03:57:08.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: This was the place where the first mass was said.

asr-004735
03:57:08.320 --> 03:57:08.740
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Correct.

asr-004736
03:57:09.680 --> 03:57:11.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pakatapos, gigibain lang ninyo.

asr-004737
03:57:11.560 --> 03:57:12.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi ninyo pinaparehab.

asr-004738
03:57:12.880 --> 03:57:18.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: The good congressman has all his rights to confront you right here.

asr-004739
03:57:18.200 --> 03:57:20.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, Larry Bukas,

asr-004740
03:57:20.260 --> 03:57:23.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: dalahin mo na ngayon. Ikaw na mag-explain doon.

asr-004741
03:57:23.340 --> 03:57:24.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004742
03:57:24.720 --> 03:57:30.600
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: From the dear family secretary, hope you will understand my sentiment.

asr-004743
03:57:30.600 --> 03:57:35.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I will, this is the first time na-raise po ito.

asr-004744
03:57:35.340 --> 03:57:37.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi, my district is a lone district.

asr-004745
03:57:37.720 --> 03:57:43.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, first time po ito nagkaroon ng congressman na dyan taga mismo sa bayan na yan.

asr-004746
03:57:43.600 --> 03:57:44.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Isama mo na ako doon sa discussion.

asr-004747
03:57:45.180 --> 03:57:47.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para kasama ako sa rehab.

asr-004748
03:57:48.720 --> 03:57:50.560
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Anyway, I have a pending...

asr-004749
03:57:50.560 --> 03:57:52.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: resolution to investigate this matter.

asr-004750
03:57:53.180 --> 03:57:55.720
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pero, we will take a look at that.

asr-004751
03:57:55.720 --> 03:57:58.500
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: [unclear] nung island. Nasira na, wala na kahoy.

asr-004753
03:58:00.560 --> 03:58:05.980
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: What we are talking here now, Mr. Chair, is only one of five MPSA.

asr-004755
03:58:06.960 --> 03:58:10.820
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At kada isa po dyan, sinap-chap, yung lima na yan.

asr-004757
03:58:10.820 --> 03:58:14.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Isama mo na ako dyan. Dalawa na tayo magre-reklamo.

asr-004759
03:58:14.880 --> 03:58:22.520
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Anyway, my time is up. Maraming salamat po. I will register my... second round. Maraming salamat po.

asr-004764
03:58:22.660 --> 03:58:31.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At least, that is an eye-opener, Sigmich, na isang maliit na isla, pinagtutulungan ng maraming hindi natin kilala

asr-004768
03:58:31.740 --> 03:58:39.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kasi hiding under one MPSA and hindi natin kilala yung mga nag-ooperate, citizenship and all.

asr-004771
03:58:40.880 --> 03:58:50.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, siguro, linisin na natin yan. At, I'm with you na yung concern ninyo. Maliit na isla yan. Madali naman i-rehab yan.

asr-004776
03:58:50.580 --> 03:58:54.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Si Larry, after you go to his office tomorrow, can you see me in my office?

asr-004782
03:58:59.940 --> 03:59:01.520
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sir, maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004783
03:59:01.620 --> 03:59:03.500
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I will be with you not only in the rehab.

asr-004784
03:59:05.500 --> 03:59:06.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pagtulungan natin ito.

asr-004785
03:59:06.580 --> 03:59:07.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ayusin natin.

asr-004786
03:59:07.360 --> 03:59:11.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil, marami nang masyado na masyadong binabastos

asr-004787
03:59:11.320 --> 03:59:12.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung ating mining laws eh.

asr-004788
03:59:12.540 --> 03:59:13.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Masyadong binabastos.

asr-004789
03:59:13.940 --> 03:59:15.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi natin kilala yung mga nag-ooperate yan.

asr-004790
03:59:16.540 --> 03:59:19.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, I will be with the good congressman

asr-004791
03:59:19.460 --> 03:59:20.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: para pagtulungan yan.

asr-004792
03:59:20.540 --> 03:59:22.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi napakaliit yung isla.

asr-004793
03:59:22.920 --> 03:59:23.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tapos, nadaanan ko yan.

asr-004794
03:59:23.880 --> 03:59:24.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Helicopter.

asr-004795
03:59:25.640 --> 03:59:26.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sirang-sira talaga.

asr-004796
03:59:28.000 --> 03:59:30.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That was last year.

asr-004797
03:59:32.100 --> 03:59:33.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sirang-sira na yan.

asr-004798
03:59:33.260 --> 03:59:34.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Usec Fragada.

asr-004799
03:59:34.900 --> 03:59:36.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung isla ng Humonhon.

asr-004800
03:59:36.720 --> 03:59:37.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Grabe talaga kasira.

asr-004801
03:59:37.660 --> 03:59:38.700
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: With all honesty naman po,

asr-004802
03:59:39.160 --> 03:59:40.440
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: nakakatulong naman talaga sa tao.

asr-004803
03:59:40.640 --> 03:59:43.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pero, siyempre, pwede naman makatulong sa tao.

asr-004804
03:59:45.120 --> 03:59:46.120
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sir, Mr. Chair.

asr-004805
03:59:46.200 --> 03:59:49.100
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pwede naman po makatulong sa tao na maayos din yung pag-operate.

asr-004807
03:59:49.980 --> 03:59:50.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasama mo ako dyan.

asr-004808
03:59:51.340 --> 03:59:51.780
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Salamat.

asr-004808-split-1
03:59:52.020 --> 03:59:52.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-004809
03:59:58.500 --> 03:59:59.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Are you here?

asr-004810
04:00:01.420 --> 04:00:02.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please, go ahead.

asr-004811
04:00:03.260 --> 04:00:03.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: How many minutes do you need?

asr-004812
04:00:04.220 --> 04:00:04.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: One, two?

asr-004813
04:00:06.100 --> 04:00:07.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay, three minutes daw.

asr-004814
04:00:08.660 --> 04:00:10.020
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Thank you, Chairman.

asr-004815
04:00:11.660 --> 04:00:24.140
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I missed the Congressman Rufus motion to increase the budget so I join. Can I still join, Chairman?

asr-004822
04:00:24.680 --> 04:00:28.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: You can make a secondary motion which we will disapprove.

asr-004824
04:00:29.920 --> 04:00:30.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Disapprove na.

asr-004825
04:00:30.880 --> 04:00:31.480
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Okay.

asr-004826
04:00:31.480 --> 04:00:33.080
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Kidding aside, really,

asr-004827
04:00:33.940 --> 04:00:47.260
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: the DENR has been an outstanding department ever since and more so with the new, and I would like to congratulate the new Secretary, Ms. Cuna, for bringing you good people here

asr-004834
04:00:47.860 --> 04:01:01.380
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: and I could not help but come after listening in my room and give you the honor and the kind of support, active support, and that is for the increase of your budget.

asr-004841
04:01:02.260 --> 04:01:03.600
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I have two questions.

asr-004842
04:01:03.860 --> 04:01:10.860
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: First, is there a budget for planting and replanting?

asr-004846
04:01:11.920 --> 04:01:25.320
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: If not, that is a good augmentation that we call additional income. Maybe there was a big, big, big, slush on your budget on planting.

asr-004853
04:01:27.340 --> 04:01:28.620
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: But then, is there any?

asr-004854
04:01:28.960 --> 04:01:33.340
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Or is there any suggestion for an augmentation of that?

asr-004856
04:01:34.300 --> 04:01:36.380
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, for your question.

asr-004858
04:01:36.640 --> 04:01:43.740
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Right now, our target for planting this coming year, Mr. Chair, is 18,000 hectares.

asr-004862
04:01:44.120 --> 04:01:45.080
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: 18,000?

asr-004862-split-1
04:01:46.820 --> 04:01:47.420
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Magkano?

asr-004863
04:01:49.380 --> 04:01:50.720
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Saan?

asr-004864
04:01:51.640 --> 04:01:52.980
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Ito?

asr-004865
04:01:53.340 --> 04:01:54.220
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: 30 million?

asr-004865-split-1
04:01:55.020 --> 04:01:58.680
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Hindi, magkano? 30? Okay.

asr-004866
04:01:58.960 --> 04:02:09.500
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So, sorry, Mr. Chair. The target for enhancement is 30,375 hectares for this coming year.

asr-004870
04:02:09.500 --> 04:02:19.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 30,000 hectares for enhancement? What do you mean by that, Mr. Secretary? We are not conversing with enhancement. Is this a timber stand improvement?

asr-004876
04:02:24.960 --> 04:02:38.120
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Ang ibig sabihin ng enhancement, Mr. Chair, is that meron ng planting dun, previously, para to revisit it kasi yung mga survival rate, so, enhancement siya para hindi bagong area.

asr-004883
04:02:38.120 --> 04:02:44.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay. So, 30,000. This is part of your 1.6 billion request, doon sa greening?

asr-004886
04:02:45.560 --> 04:02:46.760
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: It is, Mr. Chair.

asr-004887
04:02:46.860 --> 04:02:53.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: There is a budget of 1.6 billion request for the greening. Kasama yan doon sa scooping.

asr-004891
04:02:53.500 --> 04:03:00.980
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Was it included in the proposal for a 500 million? Was it included?

asr-004895
04:03:02.780 --> 04:03:05.060
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: No, I think there was no mention about that.

asr-004897
04:03:05.060 --> 04:03:14.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yung additional, Mr. Chair, it's not part of that additional 550 plus. It's part of the 1.6 billion.

asr-004901
04:03:14.120 --> 04:03:17.840
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yes. The 1.6 billion for the national greening program, Mr. Chair.

asr-004903
04:03:20.380 --> 04:03:32.680
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Can you describe what we've done with the money in case that it be augmented? What is the scope of work and the kind of results that we will need to see in a few years?

asr-004910
04:03:35.060 --> 04:03:39.440
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: I beg your indulgence, Mr. Chair, which fund are you referring to, Mr. Chair?

asr-004913
04:03:39.700 --> 04:03:43.260
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: The one that is for replanting or we call rehabilitation.

asr-004915
04:03:43.920 --> 04:03:49.940
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Yeah. Mr. Chair, for this, I'd like to defer to the Forest Management Bureau.

asr-004918
04:03:52.780 --> 04:03:53.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: MB?

asr-004918-split-1
04:03:57.100 --> 04:04:00.880
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I see an outstanding personnel also. A really big thing.

asr-004921
04:04:04.260 --> 04:04:07.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Attorney, bakit ka tumatakbo? Upo ka diyan.

asr-004924
04:04:13.260 --> 04:04:23.580
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: Mr. Chair, for NGP 2027, meron po tayong target for 30,000 hectares.

asr-004929
04:04:25.060 --> 04:04:41.620
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: The activities po doon includes enrichment planting, may reforestation pa rin tayo, may agroforestry, and protection of the assisted natural regeneration.

asr-004938
04:04:43.820 --> 04:04:49.660
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: So, ang total budget po natin, dito is 408 million for the 30,000 hectares.

asr-004943
04:04:53.520 --> 04:04:56.540
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I thought there was 1 point something billion.

asr-004945
04:04:56.540 --> 04:04:59.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 1.6 for the total greening.

asr-004946
04:05:00.480 --> 04:05:07.500
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: So, the needed thing to replant or we call rehabilitate those planted already is 400 billion?

asr-004951
04:05:09.000 --> 04:05:10.040
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: 400 million?

asr-004952
04:05:11.320 --> 04:05:12.520
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: 408 million.

asr-004953
04:05:12.940 --> 04:05:13.280
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: Okay.

asr-004954
04:05:14.640 --> 04:05:26.380
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: In due time, Chairman, we should be able to increase the budget, including this rehabilitation of planted already areas.

asr-004959
04:05:26.380 --> 04:05:35.220
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Because, you know, what is the purpose of having a land when in fact, you have planted, and yet, you don't keep it, you don't develop it, no?

asr-004964
04:05:35.520 --> 04:05:51.640
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: So, there should be a accompanying budget for it, no? So, Chairman, may I propose that be included in the increased budget for DNR? This 400 million budget for...

asr-004972
04:05:51.640 --> 04:05:57.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: We have to request the Secretary to write again for your suggestion in addition to.

asr-004975
04:05:57.440 --> 04:06:17.700
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Okay. So, Secretary Mitch, can you please request for this budget? Because I have moved for the inclusion of this in due time for the increase including the budget for the approval of this, for the rehabilitation of these planted lands.

asr-004985
04:06:17.700 --> 04:06:23.260
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: There's also one one more topic, Chairman.

asr-004988
04:06:23.560 --> 04:06:23.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Go ahead, go ahead.

asr-004989
04:06:24.720 --> 04:06:28.260
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: And this involves the Department Administrative Order.

asr-004991
04:06:29.060 --> 04:06:40.080
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: You know, the stewardship awarded to people, no? Is considered as a lifetime title to the poor people, no?

asr-004996
04:06:40.340 --> 04:06:42.460
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: You give stewardship contracts, di ba?

asr-004998
04:06:42.740 --> 04:06:47.100
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: After you create a CBFM, then you support it, everything.

asr-005001
04:06:47.980 --> 04:06:52.220
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: In my mind, this is the poor man's title.

asr-005003
04:06:54.660 --> 04:06:59.740
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Nearly, probably, we will have a law that will convert it into a title itself.

asr-005007
04:07:00.380 --> 04:07:09.040
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Because I have met people that have outgrown after 25 years and they don't know. Anong gawin nilang dito? Kontrata lang man ito eh.

asr-005011
04:07:09.840 --> 04:07:13.160
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: So they see that there is some lacking in it.

asr-005013
04:07:13.160 --> 04:07:19.680
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Government gives stewardship, but it is not enough. To survive the meaning.

asr-005017
04:07:20.060 --> 04:07:32.280
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: The idea of stewardship is not title itself. Under the Torrens title, that becomes indefeasible for you. It becomes permanent, no? And it's handed to your generations.

asr-005024
04:07:33.540 --> 04:07:55.500
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: So I will be putting, I will be filing a law that will consider all lands covered by stewardship under the torrents system. And we will reclassify these lands. How many are those in your estimate? It will be covered under it. Those under who had their stewardship contracts. How many?

asr-005035
04:07:57.120 --> 04:08:20.380
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Mr. Chair, just to clarify, Mr. Chair, when stewardship contracts were still being issued before, this is good for only 25 years, renewable for another 25 years. So hindi po for, hindi for titling.

asr-005048
04:08:23.820 --> 04:08:32.180
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: But if we consider a law that will consider converting this from stewardship to titles, what do you say about that, Secretary?

asr-005053
04:08:33.840 --> 04:08:40.040
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Well, it would be a reclassification, Mr. Chair, from forest lands to A&amp;D.

asr-005056
04:08:40.080 --> 04:08:43.580
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Because for all intents and purposes, this has been deleted,

asr-005058
04:08:45.780 --> 04:09:00.100
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: named to a certain person, you have the technical description, everything. And it is a matter of converting it into titles. So that is, in my mind, is also an out-of-the-box solution to poverty.

asr-005067
04:09:00.840 --> 04:09:01.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Stewardship contracts.

asr-005068
04:09:02.320 --> 04:09:02.820
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Yes.

asr-005069
04:09:04.620 --> 04:09:07.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Cannot ripen into a title, Mr. Congressman.

asr-005071
04:09:07.380 --> 04:09:12.400
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I know, I know. But a law should be had in order to convert it.

asr-005073
04:09:12.460 --> 04:09:14.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: You pass a law and then we will co-sponsor it.

asr-005075
04:09:15.500 --> 04:09:17.600
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Thank you. But I'm not finished yet.

asr-005076
04:09:17.760 --> 04:09:20.100
