DENR OIC Assistant Secretary for Field Operations - Mindanao and BMB Director Felix S. Alicer: With respect to the allocation of each region, at the start of the budget proposal, each region will be given that fiscal space, and they will be allocating. So the proposal will emanate from the regional office as to what priority activities they will propose.

asr-005213
04:13:57.900 --> 04:14:13.200
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: So, Mr. Chair, if I get this right, it only is dependent on what the regional office submits, rather than the area, hectareage, the amount of what has to be protected? Would that be correct, Mr. Chair?

asr-005221
