DENR OIC Assistant Secretary for Field Operations - Mindanao and BMB Director Felix S. Alicer: Yeah. So far as the operationalization of the protected area management board, we have the standard cost for the conduct of meeting and support. Administrative support.

asr-005229
04:14:28.600 --> 04:14:44.720
DENR OIC Assistant Secretary for Field Operations - Mindanao and BMB Director Felix S. Alicer: But insofar as the rehabilitation effort, you have to play around the fiscal space which is allocated by the region. And of course, it has to be endorsed by the PAMBI as to what kind of activity or work and financial plan that they have to approve.

asr-005237
04:14:46.160 --> 04:14:59.380
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Okay. Okay. Mr. Chair, so if I get this right, the fiscal space is the main determinant of what is to be allocated for the legislated protected areas natin.

asr-005240
