Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Yes, please.

asr-005244
04:15:16.040 --> 04:15:22.060
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: Also, the factor, one important factor is kung magkano i-allocate sa amin rin, Mr. Chair.

asr-005245
04:15:22.240 --> 04:15:25.420
DENR Acting Secretary Juan Miguel T. Cuna: So we try to be equitable in our distribution.

asr-005246
04:15:26.920 --> 04:15:37.380
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Mr. Chair, the reason why I'm asking this is because I think it's also about time na rin, aside from, of course, suggesting the increase of the budget of DENR,

asr-005248
04:15:38.100 --> 04:15:45.760
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: that maybe there should be a formula in place na rin to at least accurately and rightfully allocate funding

asr-005249
04:15:45.760 --> 04:15:51.040
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: For areas that are based on needs, actual needs, and not just fiscal space.

asr-005251
04:15:51.400 --> 04:15:58.580
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Kasi I think maraming nalilimit din sa pag-funding with that kind of quote-unquote formula in place.

asr-005252
04:15:58.580 --> 04:16:06.420
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Pero I think it's also fair to say siguro, and this is by no means any disrespect,

asr-005253
04:16:06.760 --> 04:16:11.600
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: but I think we're ratifying habits instead of actual needs.

asr-005254
04:16:12.620 --> 04:16:17.860
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Kung ano yung available lang, kung ano yung pwedeng i-allocate sa kada region.

asr-005255
04:16:18.320 --> 04:16:24.360
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: So I think maybe, Mr. Chair, I think moving forward, maybe we can also submit na lang siguro,

asr-005256
04:16:24.360 --> 04:16:31.920
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: in the future na lang siguro, proposed funding formula for protected areas.

asr-005257
04:16:32.260 --> 04:16:39.680
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: The reason why I'm bringing this up, Mr. Chair, is because we also have a UNESCO heritage site din sa Davao Oriental,

asr-005258
04:16:40.000 --> 04:16:41.720
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: which is Mount Hamigitan.

asr-005259
04:16:42.580 --> 04:16:51.300
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: And this one boasts 16,923 hectares of protected land with a 9,000 plus hectare buffer zone.

asr-005260
04:16:51.680 --> 04:16:53.660
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: And so that's the reason why I'm asking.

asr-005261
04:16:53.660 --> 04:16:57.120
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Kasi ako, I hike the place din.

asr-005262
04:16:57.200 --> 04:17:04.560
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: And I think it's also one thing that's best to show to not only sa mga kababayan, pero also to internationally din.

asr-005263
04:17:04.840 --> 04:17:13.280
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: So maybe, Mr. Chair, we can maybe ask also in the future na mag-submit din po yung department for proposed funding allocation

asr-005274
04:17:13.280 --> 04:17:26.080
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: in terms of at least yung formula na pwede natin ma-propose din for future funding. But at least there's also a more concrete funding mechanism para sa DENR, Mr. Chair.

asr-005276
