Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Go

asr-005277
04:17:31.820 --> 04:17:35.120
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Okay Mr. Chair. And the next one would be, I'll just make this quick na rin.

asr-005279
