asr-005285
04:18:23.780 --> 04:18:30.400
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: Kasi dati yung mga permanent forest ranger natin ay konti lang po.

asr-005286
04:18:31.500 --> 04:18:51.100
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: That's why we're requesting and proposing budget para madagdagan yung forest protection officers. At, ah... Nung isang taon, for 2026, ang ratio po natin ay 1 is to 3,000 hectares.

asr-005289
