asr-005307
04:20:05.660 --> 04:20:33.520
Rep. Cheeno Miguel D. Almario: Ah... It is human capital. It is also... Naka-depende din sa kung gaano kalusog yung forest rangers din po natin. And, I think 3,000 hectares takes a toll on anybody. Impossible po, Mr. Chair. Ah... Last would be, I guess, siguro yung sa... With regards also to NGC... Ah... NGP, rather. Ah... I believe yung, ano, yung... Ah... Majority of the priority will be given to Sierra Madre. Would this be correct, Mr. Chair?

