asr-005660
04:30:38.540 --> 04:30:44.460
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: So I hope you will give time for them to identify and evaluate the operation.

asr-005661
04:30:45.500 --> 04:30:48.540
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Para matulungan niyo po yung mga local government.

asr-005662
04:30:49.060 --> 04:30:49.220
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Why?

asr-005663
04:30:49.680 --> 04:30:58.400
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Kasi ang problema po dito is that, isa sa problema ngayon ng Davao de Oro is that yung siltation problem namin sa river basin.

asr-005664
04:30:59.680 --> 04:31:08.420
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Na sa dami-daming small scale na hindi nare-regulate, lahat ng waste disposal nila nandun na sa mga river basin namin.

asr-005665
04:31:08.560 --> 04:31:09.920
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Major river basin.

asr-005666
04:31:10.220 --> 04:31:15.260
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Kaya pagdating ng malakas na ulan, yung baha po dun sa baba, sa downstream,

asr-005667
04:31:15.760 --> 04:31:17.680
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: hindi na po makukontrol.

asr-005668
04:31:18.340 --> 04:31:24.720
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: So the invert elevation of the natural ground and the river basin, river bed is opposite.

asr-005669
04:31:27.180 --> 04:31:30.140
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Mas mababa na po, mas mataas yung sa ilog.

asr-005670
04:31:30.240 --> 04:31:32.300
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: So hindi na kami makakapag-discharge.

asr-005671
04:31:32.340 --> 04:31:40.080
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: The local government unit cannot improve the tributaries, the canal that would discharge the water to the river.

asr-005672
04:31:41.320 --> 04:31:42.560
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Magahanap na po ng option.

asr-005673
04:31:42.880 --> 04:31:44.620
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: So yun po ang nire-regulate ngayon.

asr-005674
04:31:44.820 --> 04:31:53.680
Rep. Leonel "Jhong" D. Ceniza: Province of Davao de Oro and the local government unit para makontrol po yung waste disposal ng mga small scale miners.

asr-005675
