asr-009016
06:38:20.740 --> 06:38:33.980
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: What specific budget does DNR have for watershed rehabilitation and protection, particularly in critical watersheds that serve the source of water and also as natural protection against flooding?

asr-009017
06:38:33.980 --> 06:38:46.320
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: And how does DENR coordinate with DPWH so that flood control projects do not inadvertently damage the very ecosystem that are supposed to mitigate flooding?

asr-009019
06:38:46.520 --> 06:38:47.640
