Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: From the chair: pwede ba magtanong? Bakit mo tinatawag na critical? Ano yung criteria mo sa critical?

asr-009062
06:43:02.840 --> 06:43:56.500
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: Meron po tayong definition, working definition ng critical watershed. Ang sinasabi po, it is based on PD 705. It is a drainage area of a river system supplying existing and proposed hydroelectric power, irrigation works, and domestic water facilities needing immediate protection and rehabilitation. So yung mga identified watershed, yung mga watershed na bumabagsak po sa definition na ito, na supporting existing and proposed hydroelectric power, irrigation works, and domestic water utilities, ay nakaklasify po natin siya as critical watershed.

