asr-010002
07:32:36.960 --> 07:32:43.460
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: We can approve a number of operating agreements po from one MPSA.

asr-010003
07:32:43.460 --> 07:32:54.060
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: However, nagkaroon na nga po ng mga problems with regards to a single MPSA operated by several or a number of operators.

asr-010004
07:32:54.220 --> 07:32:55.080
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Nagka-problema po.

asr-010005
07:32:55.340 --> 07:33:04.920
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Kaya po nung 2021 or 2022, we issued a policy of prohibiting more than one.

asr-010006
07:33:04.980 --> 07:33:08.420
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: One operator, one MPSA po ang nilabas ng DENR.

asr-010007
