Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I will read.

asr-010013
07:33:37.880 --> 07:33:45.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Violation of the terms and condition of the permits or agreements shall be a sufficient ground for cancellation of the same.

asr-010014
